tent": "4.2 信息的度量 …… 141"}]}, {"type": "text", "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "4.3 联合熵与条件熵 …… 150"}]}, {"type": "text", "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "4.4 互信息与平均互信息 …… 156"}]}, {"type": "text", "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "4.5 离散信源 …… 161"}]}, {"type": "text", "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "4.6 信息论在密码学中的应用 …… 176"}]}, {"type": "text", "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "习题四 …… 181"}]}, {"type": "text", "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "第5章 计算复杂性基础 …… 185"}]}, {"type": "text", "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "5.1 时空复杂性与算法分析 …… 186"}]}, {"type": "text", "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "5.2 确定图灵机与P类问题 …… 191"}]}, {"type": "text", "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "5.3 RAM模型 …… 197"}]}, {"type": "text", "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "5.4 非确定性图灵机与NP类问题 …… 200"}]}, {"type": "text", "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "5.5 NP完全性 …… 204"}]}, {"type": "text", "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "5.6 若干典型的NP完全问题 …… 207"}]}, {"type": "text", "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "5.7 计算复杂性理论在密码学中的应用 …… 212"}]}, {"type": "text", "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "习题五 …… 218"}]}]}]}, {"page_idx": 13, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.665, 0.139, 0.791, 0.169], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "第1章"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.573, 0.203, 0.835, 0.252], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "数论基础"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.1, 0.341, 0.844, 0.499], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "数论研究整数环中整数最基本性质, 整除理论、同余理论和不定方程求解构成数论的基本内容。随着信息技术的飞速发展, 数论所涉及的知识在信息领域特别是信息安全领域具有广泛的应用, 公钥密码标准 RSA 算法是基于大整数分解困难性而设计的, 通信系统中广泛使用的 Diffie-Hellmen 协议与整数的同余和原根密切相关。掌握数论的基本知识, 对于从事信息安全理论与应用研究具有重要作用。"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 14, "blocks": [{"type": "page_number", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.085, 0.058, 0.105, 0.071], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "2"}]}, {"type": "header", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.406, 0.056, 0.567, 0.072], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "信息安全数学基础"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.055, 0.113, 0.285, 0.136], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "1.1 整数的整除"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.096, 0.168, 0.453, 0.186], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "全体整数的集合通常用 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathbb{Z}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 来表示, 即"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.343, 0.196, 0.631, 0.213], "content": "\\mathbb {Z} = \\{0, \\pm 1, \\pm 2, \\pm 3, \\dots \\}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.051, 0.223, 0.92, 0.309], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "在整数集合 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathbb{Z}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 中,两个整数可以进行加、减、乘三种运算,并且运算后的结果仍为整数。但两个整数进行除法运算后所得的结果未必为整数,比如4除以2所得结果为2,它是一个整数,而4除以3所得结果为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\frac{4}{3}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ,它不是整数。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.051, 0.331, 0.919, 0.377], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定义 1.1 设 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a, b"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是任意两个整数, "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "b \\neq 0"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 如果存在整数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "c"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 使得 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a = bc"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 则称 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "b"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 整除 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 记做 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "b \\mid a"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 否则称 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "b"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 不整除 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 记做 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "b \\nmid a"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.051, 0.393, 0.919, 0.439], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "如果有 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "b \\mid a"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，称 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "b"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的因数，"}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "b"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的倍数。显然 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\pm 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是任何整数的因数，所有的非零整数均为 0 的因数。由整除的定义，易知如下性质成立:"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.098, 0.448, 0.4, 0.466], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(1) 如果  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "c \\mid b, b \\mid a"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，则  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "c \\mid a;"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.097, 0.476, 0.711, 0.494], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(2) 如果 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "c \\mid b, c \\mid a"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 则对任意 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "m, n \\in \\mathbb{Z}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 均有 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "c \\mid (ma + nb)"}, {"type": "text", "content": ";"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.097, 0.502, 0.501, 0.521], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(3) 如果 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "b \\mid a"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，且 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a \\neq 0"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，则 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "|b| \\leqslant |a|"}, {"type": "text", "content": "；"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.098, 0.53, 0.578, 0.549], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(4) 如果 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a \\mid b, b \\mid a"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，则 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "|a| = |b|"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，即 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a = \\pm b"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.097, 0.566, 0.677, 0.584], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "例1.1 证明:对任意正整数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，均有 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "6 \\mid n(n + 1)(2n + 1)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 13, "bbox": [0.096, 0.601, 0.899, 0.619], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "证明 当 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n = 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 时，"}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n(n + 1)(2n + 1) = 1 \\times 2 \\times 3 = 6"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，它是6的倍数，结论成立。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 14, "bbox": [0.097, 0.628, 0.399, 0.646], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "假设当 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n = k"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 时，结论成立，即"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 15, "bbox": [0.38, 0.657, 0.592, 0.674], "content": "6 \\mid k (k + 1) (2 k + 1)"}, {"type": "text", "index": 16, "bbox": [0.053, 0.683, 0.27, 0.701], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "则当 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n = k + 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 时，有"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 17, "bbox": [0.101, 0.711, 0.87, 0.728], "content": "n (n + 1) (2 n + 1) = (k + 1) (k + 2) (2 k + 3) = k (k + 1) (2 k + 1) + 6 (k + 1) ^ {2}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 18, "bbox": [0.054, 0.739, 0.897, 0.758], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "由归纳假设， "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "6 \\mid k(k+1)(2k+1)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，并且 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "6 \\mid 6(k+1)^{2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，从而根据整除的性质(3)，得到"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 19, "bbox": [0.349, 0.767, 0.622, 0.784], "content": "6 \\mid (k + 1) (k + 2) (2 k + 3)"}, {"type": "text", "index": 20, "bbox": [0.054, 0.794, 0.634, 0.812], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "由归纳法原理， "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "6\\mid n(n + 1)(2n + 1)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 对任意正整数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 成立。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 21, "bbox": [0.096, 0.822, 0.907, 0.841], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "例1.2 如果 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "m, n, r, q \\in \\mathbb{Z}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，并且 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(m - p) \\mid (mn + pq)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，证明 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(m - p) \\mid (mq + np)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 22, "bbox": [0.097, 0.857, 0.221, 0.875], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "证明 由于"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 23, "bbox": [0.074, 0.886, 0.895, 0.903], "content": "m q + n p = m q - p q + p q + m n - m n + n p = q (m - p) + (m n + p q) - n (m - p)"}, {"type": "text", "index": 24, "bbox": [0.055, 0.912, 0.457, 0.93], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "上式右边三项都是 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "m - p"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的倍数，从而有"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 15, "blocks": [{"type": "header", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.435, 0.065, 0.596, 0.08], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "第1章 数论基础"}]}, {"type": "page_number", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.898, 0.067, 0.916, 0.079], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "3"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.407, 0.1, 0.624, 0.117], "content": "(m - p) \\mid (m q + n p)"}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.082, 0.126, 0.946, 0.172], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定理 1.1(带余除法) 设 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a, b \\in \\mathbb{Z}, b \\neq 0"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 则存在唯一的 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "q, r \\in \\mathbb{Z}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 使得 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a = bq + r"}, {"type": "text", "