": "text", "content": " 时， "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(n - 1)! \\equiv -1 \\bmod n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 显然成立。当 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n > 3"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 时，令 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "S = \\{2,3,\\dots, n - 2\\}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，则 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "|S| = n - 3"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。对任意 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x \\in S"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，由于 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为素数，则 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(x, n) = 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，于是存在唯一 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "y \\in S"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，使得 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "xy \\equiv 1 \\bmod n"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，并且 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x \\neq y"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。记 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "y = x^{-1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，如果 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x' \\in S"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，并且 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x \\neq x'"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，则 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x'^{-1} \\neq x^{-1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，从而 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "S"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 中 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n - 3"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 数个两两互逆，于是 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(n - 2)! \\equiv 1 \\bmod n"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，故 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(n - 1)! \\equiv -1 \\bmod n"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.055, 0.739, 0.924, 0.895], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "例 1.8 的结果称为 Wilson 定理, 利用 Wilson 定理可以进行整数的素性测试, 并且该方法是确定性算法。但如果分析一下该算法中乘除法的次数, 就会发现当 n 比较大时, 计算上是不可行的。事实上, 利用 Wilson 定理进行素性测试, 需做 n-2 次乘法和 1 次除法。当 n 为