1}, \\delta_{2}, \\delta_{3}, \\cdots"}, {"type": "text", "content": " , 那么, 可以猜测 m 为这些  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\delta_{i}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  的最大公因子的因子。重合指数法的基本原理是: 记  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "I_{c}(x)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  是含 n 个字符的字符串  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x = x_{1}x_{2}\\cdots x_{n}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  的重合指数, 即  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x = x_{1}x_{2}\\cdots x_{n}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  中两个随机元素相同的概率。那么, 当字符串  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x = x_{1}x_{2}\\cdots x_{n}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  是随机字符串时, 重合指数的取值具有如下特征为"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.354, 0.87, 0.653, 0.906], "content": "I _ {c} (x) \\approx 2 6 \\times \\left(\\frac {1}{2 6}\\right) ^ {2} = 0. 0 3 8"}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.07, 0.915, 0.819, 0.934], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "当字符串  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x = x_{1}x_{2}\\cdots x_{n}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  是英语文本字符串时，重合指数的取值具有如下特征"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 46, "blocks": [{"type": "page_number", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.096, 0.056, 0.124, 0.068], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "34"}]}, {"type": "header", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.416, 0.054, 0.577, 0.069], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "信息安全数学基础"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.376, 0.089, 0.618, 0.129], "content": "I _ {c} (x) \\approx \\sum_ {i = 0} ^ {2 5} p _ {i} ^ {2} = 0. 0 6 5"}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.062, 0.134, 0.903, 0.153], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "其中 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "p_0, p_1, \\cdots, p_{25}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 分别表示英文字母 A, B, "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\cdots"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", Z 的概率, 它们的值分别如表 1.2 所示。"}]}, {"type": "table", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.064, 0.185, 0.928, 0.479], "content": [{"type": "table_caption", "index": 4, "bbo