31, 0.729], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "然后分别计算每一个子串的重合指数,当每一个子串的重合指数均大约为 0.065 时,则 m 就是密钥字的长度。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.062, 0.738, 0.931, 0.843], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "不管是采用Kasiski测试法还是重合指数法,一旦得到了密钥字的长度m,就可以将密文串按上述方式分割成m个子串 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "y^{(1)},y^{(2)},\\cdots,y^{(m)}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ,对每一个子串 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "y^{(i)}(1\\leqslant i\\leqslant m)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ,统计每一个字母出现的频率,频率最高的字母一定是与字母E对应,从而可以确定移位量 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "k_{i}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ,得到密钥字 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "k=(k_{1},k_{2},\\cdots,k_{m})"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.062, 0.853, 0.932, 0.928], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "希尔密码是另一种多表代换密码,其主要思想是利用 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "Z_{26}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 上线性变换将长度为m的明文串加密成长度为m的密文串。希尔密码的数学模型如下:设 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "m\\geqslant2"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是一个正整数,明文空间P和密文空间C均为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(Z_{26})^{m}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ,密钥空间K是 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "Z_{26}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 上的所有m阶可逆矩阵的集合。对"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 47, "blocks": [{"type": "header", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.419, 0.061, 0.581, 0.077], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "第1章 数论基础"}]}, {"type": "page_number", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.873, 0.063, 0.901, 0.076], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "35"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.066, 0.097, 0.888, 0.199], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "每一个密钥  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "k = \\begin{bmatrix} k_{11} & k_{12} & \\cdots & k_{1m} \\\\ k_{21} & k_{22} & \\cdots & k_{2m} \\\\ \\vdots & \\vdots & & \\vdots \\\\ k_{m1} & k_{m2} & \\cdots & k_{mm} \\end{bmatrix} \\in K"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，定义如下的加密变换和解密变换分别为"}], "continues_prev": true}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.11, 0.208, 0.762, 0.312], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "加密变换: "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(y_{1},y_{2},\\cdots,y_{m})=(x_{1},x_{2},\\cdots,x_{m})\\left[\\begin{array}{cccc}k_{11}&k_{12}&\\cdots&k_{m}\\\\ k_{21}&k_{22}&\\cdots&k_{2m}\\\\ \\vdots&\\vdots&&\\vdots\\\\ k_{m1}&k_{m2}&\\cdots&k_{mn}\\end{array}\\right]"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.113, 0.363, 0.22, 0.382], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "解密变换:"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.222, 0.319, 0.783, 0.426], "content": "(x _ {1}, x _ {2}, \\dots , x _ {m}) = (y _ {1}, y _ {2}, \\dots , y _ {m}) \\left[ \\begin{array}{c c c c} k _ {1 1} & k _ {1 2} & \\dots & k _ {m} \\\\ k _ {2 1} & k _ {2 2} & \\dots & k _ {2 m} \\\\ \\vdots & \\vdots & & \\vdots \\\\ k _ {m 1} & k _ {m 2} & \\dots & k _ {m m} \\end{array} \\right] ^ {- 1}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.114, 0.434, 0.464, 0.452], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "以上所有运算都是在 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathbb{Z}_{26}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 上进行的。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.068, 0.462, 0.937, 0.594], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "需要注意的是, "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "Z_{26}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 上一个 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "m"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 阶矩阵 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathbf{A}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 具有逆矩阵当且仅当 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(|\\mathbf{A}|, 26) = 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 这里 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "|\\mathbf{A}|"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 表示矩阵 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathbf{A}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的行列式。采用唯密文攻击希尔密码是很困难的, 但如果已知一些明文和相应的密文, 则不难破译希尔密码。事实上, 假定敌手已经确认了正在使用的 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "m"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 值, 并且至少有 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "m"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 个不同的明密文对, 设为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x_{j} = (x_{1j}, x_{2j}, \\cdots, x_{mj}), y_{j} = (y_{1j}, y_{2j}, \\cdots, y_{mj}), j = 1, 2, \\cdots, m"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 如果矩阵"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.368, 0.606, 0.635, 0.706], "content": "\\boldsymbol {x} = \\left[ \\begin{array}{c c c c} x _ {1 1} & x _ {1 2} & \\dots & x _ {1 m} \\\\ x _ {2 1} & x _ {2 2} & \\dots & x _ {2 m} \\\\ \\vdots & \\vdots & & \\vdots \\\\ x _ {m 1} & x _ {m 2} & \\dots & x _ {m m} \\end{array} \\right]"}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.069, 0.714, 0.618, 0.732], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "恰好是可逆矩阵,那么密钥矩阵 k 就可以由下式给出,即"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.137, 0.742, 0.868, 0.846], "content": "\\boldsymbol {k} = \\left[ \\begin{array}{c c c c} k _ {1 1} & k _ {1 2} & \\dots & k _ {1 m} \\\\ k _ {2 1} & k _ {2 2} & \\dots & k _ {2 m} \\\\ \\vdots & \\vdots & & \\vdots \\\\ k _ {m 1} & k _ {m 2} & \\dots & k _ {m m} \\end{array} \\right] = \\left[ \\begin{array}{c c c c} x _ {1 1} & x _ {1 2} & \\dots & x _ {1 m} \\\\ x _ {2 1} & x _ {2 2} & \\dots & x _ {2 m} \\\\ \\vdots & \\vdots & & \\vdots \\\\ x _ {m 1} & x _ {m 2} & \\dots & x _ {m m} \\end{array} \\right] ^ {- 1} \\left[ \\begin{array}{c c c c} y _ {1 1} & y _ {1 2} & \\dots & y _ {1 m} \\\\ y _ {2 1} & y _ {2 2} & \\dots & y _ {2 m} \\\\ \\vdots & \\vdots & & \\vdots \\\\ y _ {m 1} & y _ {m 2} & \\dots & y _ {m m} \\end{array} \\right]"}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.071, 0.854, 0.624, 0.873], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "如果 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 不构成可逆矩阵, 则必须重新选择 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "m"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 个明密文对。"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.115, 0.889, 0.381, 0.907], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "2. RSA 算法及其数论基础"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 13, "bbox": [0.115, 0.916, 0.941, 0.935], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "在上面介绍的四类代换密码中,加密密钥和解密密钥是相同的或者由加密密钥很容"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 48, "blocks": [{"type": "page_number", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.089, 0.057, 0.116, 0.07], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "36"}]}, {"type": "header", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.41, 0.056, 0.57, 0.071], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "信息安全数学基础"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.054, 0.091, 0.925, 0.357], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "易得到解密密钥,比如移位密码的加密密钥和解密密钥均为 k; 仿射密码的加密密钥为 (a,b), 解密密钥为 ( "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a^{-1},b"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ), 这里  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a^{-1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  为 a 模 26 的乘法逆元; 维吉尼亚密码的加密密钥和解密密钥均为  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "k=(k_{1},k_{2},\\cdots,k_{m})"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ; 希尔密码的加密密钥为  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "Z_{26}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  上可逆矩阵 k, 解密密钥为 k 的逆矩阵  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "k^{-1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。20 世纪 70 年代以前的密码, 都是采用加密密钥和解密密钥相同或者实质相同的密码, 这样的密码称为对称密码或者私钥密码, 也就是说这一类密码的加密密钥和解密密钥的地位是对称的, 在实施过程中必须保证密钥的私有性, 除加解密双方外, 其他人不能知道密钥。1976 年, Diffie 和 Hellman 提出了公钥密码的思想, 指出加密密钥可以公开, 解密密钥需要保密。其安全性依赖于已知加密密钥求解密密钥在计算性上是不可行的。1978 年, Rivest、Shamir 和 Adleman 提出了第一个成熟的也是比较完整的公开密钥密码体制——RSA 算法, 该算法的安全性依赖于大整数分解困难性问题。"}], "continues_prev": true}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.055, 0.365, 0.925, 0.465], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "RSA 算法的数学模型是: 设 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n = pq"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 这里 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "p, q"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为两个大的素数, 明文空间 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "P"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和密文空间 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "C"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 均为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathbb{Z}_n"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 密钥空间为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "K = \\{(n, p, q, e, d) \\mid ed \\equiv 1 \\bmod \\varphi(n)\\}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 其中加密密钥 (亦称公钥) 为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(n, e)"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 解密密钥 (亦称私钥) 为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(p, q, d)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。对任意密钥 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "k = (n, p, q, e, d) \\in K"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 加密变换和解密变换定义如下。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.1, 0.474, 0.824, 0.492], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "加密变换为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "y = E_{k}(x) \\equiv x^{e} \\bmod n"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，解密变换为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x = D_{k}(y) \\equiv y^{d} \\bmod n"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.101, 0.501, 0.749, 0.519], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "首先,利用数论知识验证 RSA 算法的加密和解密是一对互逆运算。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.057, 0.528, 0.923, 0.601], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "对任意 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x \\in \\mathbb{Z}_n"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，如果 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x = 0"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，则 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "y = 0"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，反之亦成立。如果 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x \\neq 0"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，则当 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(x, n) = 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 时，根据欧拉定理得到:"}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x^{\\varphi(n)} \\equiv 1 \\bmod n"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。又注意到 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "ed \\equiv 1 \\bmod \\varphi(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，于是 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "ed = k\\varphi(n) + 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，这里 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "k"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为某个正整数，故"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.234, 0.61, 0.751, 0.628], "content": "y ^ {d} \\equiv (x ^ {e}) ^ {d} \\equiv x ^ {e d} \\equiv x ^ {k \\varphi (n) + 1} \\equiv (x ^ {\\varphi (n)}) ^ {k} x \\equiv x \\bmod n"}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.057, 0.638, 0.923, 0.684], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "当 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(x, n) \\neq 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，则 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x \\equiv 0 \\bmod p"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x \\equiv 0 \\bmod q"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 有且仅有一个成立。根据中国剩余定理，"}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "y^{d} \\equiv x \\bmod n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 成立当且仅当 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "y^{d} \\equiv x \\bmod p"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "y^{d} \\equiv x \\bmod q"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 同时成立。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.057, 0.692, 0.925, 0.738], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "当 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x \\equiv 0 \\bmod p"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 时, 则 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x \\neq 0 \\bmod q"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 也就是 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(x, q) = 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 这时 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x^{q-1} \\equiv 1 \\bmod q"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 于是有"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.364, 0.747, 0.621, 0.765], "content": "y ^ {d} \\equiv x ^ {e d} \\equiv 0 \\equiv x \\bmod p"}, {"type": "equation", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.127, 0.774, 0.844, 0.792], "content": "y ^ {d} \\equiv x ^ {e d} \\equiv x ^ {k \\varphi (n) + 1} \\equiv x ^ {k \\varphi (n)} x \\equiv x ^ {k (q - 1) (p - 1)} x \\equiv (x ^ {q - 1}) ^ {k (p - 1)} x \\equiv x \\bmod q"}, {"type": "text", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.058, 0.802, 0.663, 0.82], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "从而 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "y^{d} \\equiv x \\bmod n"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。类似地，当 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x \\equiv 0 \\bmod q"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 时，结论也成立。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 13, "bbox": [0.058, 0.83, 0.926, 0.931], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "其次,利用数论知识说明已知加密密钥 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(n,e)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 难以得到解密密钥 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(p,q,d)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。根据 RSA 算法的数学模型,由加密密钥 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(n,e)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 得到解密密钥 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(p,q,d)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ,一种方式是分解大整数 n = pq,如果分解了大整数 n,就可以得到两个素因子 p 和 q,同时可以计算出欧拉函数  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\varphi(n)=\\varphi(pq)=\\varphi(p)\\varphi(q)=(p-1)(q-1)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ,从而根据辗转相除法由  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "ed\\equiv1\\bmod\\varphi(n)"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 49, "blocks": [{"type": "header", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.417, 0.062, 0.578, 0.077], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "第1章 数论基础"}]}, {"type": "page_number", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.871, 0.063, 0.898, 0.076], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "37"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.065, 0.097, 0.934, 0.308], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "及 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "e"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的取值得到 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "d"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的取值。另一种方式是计算欧拉函数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\varphi(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，如果有办法在不分解 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的情况下得到 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\varphi(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，一方面可以由 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "ed \\equiv 1 \\bmod \\varphi(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 及 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "e"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的取值得到 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "d"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的取值。另一方面，注意到 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\varphi(n) = (p - 1)(q - 1) = pq - (p + q) + 1 = n - (p + q) + 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，也就是 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "p"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "q"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 满足如下两个条件:"}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "pq = n, p + q = n - \\varphi(n) + 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，这说明 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "p"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "q"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是二次方程 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x^{2} - (n - \\varphi(n) + 1)x - n = 0"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的两个零点。通过求解该二次方程，可以得到 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的素因子 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "p"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "q"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，从而得到解密密钥。分解大整数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n = pq"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和计算欧拉函数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\varphi(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是破译 RSA 算法的关键，然而这两个问题一直是数论中十分困难的问题。根据上面的分析，分解大整数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n = pq"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和计算欧拉函数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\varphi(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是等价的，只要解决了其中一个问题，那么另一个问题也就解决了。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.111, 0.316, 0.577, 0.333], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "最后,利用数论知识分析 RSA 算法的实现效益。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.111, 0.343, 0.448, 0.36], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "RSA 参数生成算法可以描述如下:"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.161, 0.37, 0.473, 0.388], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Step1: 生成两个大素数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "p"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "q"}, {"type": "text", "content": ";"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.161, 0.398, 0.591, 0.415], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Step2: "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n \\leftarrow pq"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，且 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\varphi(n) \\leftarrow (p-1)(q-1)"}, {"type": "text", "content": ";"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.162, 0.425, 0.772, 0.443], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Step3: 选取一个随机数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "e(1 < e < \\varphi(n))"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 使得 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(e, \\varphi(n)) = 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": ";"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.164, 0.453, 0.428, 0.47], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Step4:  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "d \\leftarrow e^{-1} \\mod \\varphi(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ;"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.164, 0.48, 0.552, 0.497], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Step5:公钥为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(n,e)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，私钥为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(p,q,d)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.112, 0.507, 0.428, 0.524], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "RSA 加解密算法可以描述如下:"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.164, 0.534, 0.468, 0.552], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "加密: "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "y = E_{k}(x) \\equiv x^{e} \\mod n;"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.164, 0.562, 0.471, 0.58], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "解密: "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x = D_{k}(y)\\equiv y^{d}\\bmod n"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 13, "bbox": [0.068, 0.59, 0.937, 0.718], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "在 RSA 参数生成算法和加解密算法的实施过程中, 有些计算是容易的, 比如给定两个大素数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "p"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "q"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 计算它们的乘积 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n = pq"}, {"type": "text", "content": "; 已知正整数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "e"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\varphi(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 通过辗转相除法计算 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "d = e^{-1} \\bmod \\varphi(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "; 有些计算是相对困难的, 如对于大整数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 如何计算模运算 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x^a \\bmod n"}, {"type": "text", "content": "? 如何寻找大的素数? 有些计算是非常困难的, 比如如何分解大整数? 在不知道大整数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的分解式的条件下, 如何计算欧拉函数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\varphi(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 14, "bbox": [0.069, 0.726, 0.936, 0.855], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "人们知道计算机是有字长限制的,在计算机上不能直接得到两个大整数的和、差、积、商,但通过计算机编程可以将大整数分段成小整数来表示,利用小整数的四则运算来实现大整数的四则运算。也就是说,在计算机上已知两个大素数 p 和 q,计算它们的乘积 n = pq 是很容易的一件事;同样,给定正整数 e 和  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\varphi(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  通过辗转相除法计算  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "d = e^{-1} \\mod \\varphi(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  也是一件容易的事。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 15, "bbox": [0.069, 0.863, 0.938, 0.936], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "对于给定的大整数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 直接计算 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x^{a} \\bmod n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的效率是非常低的。这是因为当 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 非常大时, 进行 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a - 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 次模乘运算需要非常多的运算时间。目前通常采用如下方法来计算 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x^{a} \\bmod n"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 该方法称为重复平方法。"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 50, "blocks": [{"type": "page_number", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.087, 0.059, 0.114, 0.072], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "38"}]}, {"type": "header", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.407, 0.058, 0.568, 0.073], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "信息安全数学基础"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.097, 0.093, 0.521, 0.11], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "首先将模指数 a 用二进制形式表示出来, 即"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.297, 0.12, 0.672, 0.16], "content": "a = \\sum_ {i = 1} ^ {l - 1} c _ {i} 2 ^ {i} = c _ {0} + c _ {1} 2 + \\dots + c _ {l - 1} 2 ^ {l - 1}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.053, 0.166, 0.428, 0.184], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "其中 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "c_{i} = 0"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 或 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "1, c_{l - 1} \\neq 0, 0 \\leqslant i \\leqslant l - 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.099, 0.194, 0.153, 0.211], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "于是"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.326, 0.223, 0.649, 0.269], "content": "x ^ {a} = x ^ {\\sum_ {i = 0} ^ {l - 1} c _ {i} 2 ^ {i}} = \\prod_ {i = 0} ^ {l - 1} (x ^ {2 ^ {i}}) ^ {c _ {i}} \\bmod n"}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.053, 0.276, 0.921, 0.329], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "根据上面的表达式, 只需将 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "c_{i} = 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 对应的那些项 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x^{2^{i}}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 做模乘运算, 并且在执行模乘运算过程中, "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x^{2^{i}}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 可以利用前面得到的项 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x^{2^{j}} (j < i)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 通过多次平方得到。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.053, 0.338, 0.925, 0.747], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "给定一个大整数 n，如何判定 n 是否为素数，这就是素性测试问题。目前素性测试方法有很多，但它们可以划分为两类，一类是概率算法，另一类是确定性算法。前者可以在允许任意小出错概率的前提下判定 n 的素性，即如果判定 n 为素数，则 n 仍然可能不是素数，只是这种可能性非常小。而后者的判定总是对的，即如果判定 n 为素数，那么 n 一定是素数。从理论上而言，总希望找到一个确定性算法来判定 n 的素性。从实际应用而言，希望所采用的算法在计算上是可行的。一个算法的运算时间总是可以表示为需要解决问题的规模的函数，如果这个函数是多项式函数，那么称该算法是多项式时间的算法，也就是通常所指的计算上可行的算法。否则称为(亚)指数时间的算法。素性测试的概率算法一般是多项式时间的算法，这些算法的理论基础简单(只涉及初等数论的知识)，实际应用广泛，如 Solovay-Strassen 算法和 Miller-Rabin 算法。素性测试的确定性算法通常是指数时间的算法，其理论基础较为复杂(利用代数数论方面的知识)，如 Jacobi 素性测试和椭圆曲线素性测试。值得一提的是，2002 年，印度理工学院的 Agrawal、Kayal 和 Saxena 三人提出了一种多项式时间的确定性的素性测试法，简称 AKS 算法。AKS 算法原理简单，采用初等数论的知识，但在实际实现时较为复杂，其运算时间比 Miller-Rabin 算法要慢很多。下面介绍 Miller-Rabin 算法和 AKS 算法。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.1, 0.755, 0.605, 0.773], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Miller-Rabin 算法基于如下的基本概念和基本定理。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.054, 0.791, 0.923, 0.868], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定义 1.14 设 n>2 是一个奇数， "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n-1=2^{s}m"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，其中 s 是一个非负整数，m>0 为奇数。对于小于 n 的正整数 b 来说，如果  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "b^{m}\\equiv1\\mod n"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  或者存在整数  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "r(0\\leqslant r<s)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，使得  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "b^{2^{r_{m}}}\\equiv-1\\mod n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，那么称 n 通过以 b 为基的 Miller-Rabin 测试。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.056, 0.885, 0.924, 0.931], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定理 1.28 设 p>2 是一个素数, 则对任意正整数 b, 只要  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(p,b)=1"}, {"type": "text", "content": " , 则 p 一定可以通过以 b 为基的 Miller-Rabin 测试。"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 51, "blocks": [{"type": "header", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.425, 0.061, 0.586, 0.077], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "第1章 数论基础"}]}, {"type": "page_number", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.878, 0.063, 0.904, 0.075], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "39"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.116, 0.096, 0.438, 0.114], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "证明 利用Fermat小定理即可。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.074, 0.132, 0.938, 0.193], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定理 1.29 如果 n>2 是一个奇合数，则至多有  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\frac{n-1}{4}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  个 b(0<b<n)，使得 n 通过以 b 为基的 Miller-Rabin 测试。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.116, 0.209, 0.325, 0.227], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "证明 参见文献[3]。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.073, 0.236, 0.938, 0.282], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "设 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n > 2"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是一个奇数, "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n - 1 = 2^{s} m"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 其中 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "s"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是一个非负整数, "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "m > 0"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为奇数。Miller-Rabin 素性测试算法可以描叙如下:"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.116, 0.291, 0.517, 0.309], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Step1: 随机选取  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "b \\in \\{1, 2, 3, \\cdots, n-1\\}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ;"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.116, 0.319, 0.402, 0.335], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Step2:  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "r \\leftarrow 0"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ;  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "z \\leftarrow b^{m} \\mod n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ;"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.117, 0.345, 0.921, 0.363], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "如果 z=1 或者 z=n-1，那么 n 通过测试，n 可能是素数，则结束；否则转 Step3。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.117, 0.373, 0.686, 0.391], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Step3: 如果 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "r = s - 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，则 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是合数，则结束；否则转 Step4。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.118, 0.401, 0.421, 0.417], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Step4:  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "r \\leftarrow r + 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ;  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "z \\leftarrow z^{2} \\mod n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.117, 0.428, 0.791, 0.445], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "如果 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "z = n - 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，则 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 通过测试，"}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 可能是素数，则结束；否则转Step3。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.073, 0.455, 0.941, 0.584], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "上述算法的输出为“n 是合数”或者“n 可能是素数”。根据定理 1.29，该算法判定 n 是素数的正确性概率至少为 75%，出错概率小于 25%。如果随机均匀地选取序列  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "b_{1}, b_{2}, \\cdots, b_{k} \\in \\{1, 2, \\cdots, n-1\\}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，对 n 进行 k 次 Miller-Rabin 素性测试，如果每次输出都为“n 可能是素数”，则 n 是合数的概率小于  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "1/4^{k}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。当 k 足够大时， "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "1/4^{k}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  是一个非常小的数，也就是说 Miller-Rabin 算法能够以非常小的出错概率判定正整数的素性。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 13, "bbox": [0.117, 0.592, 0.758, 0.61], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "AKS算法基于如下定理，该定理仍是Fermat小定理的一个推论。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 14, "bbox": [0.118, 0.627, 0.88, 0.645], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定理1.30 设 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为变量, "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a, n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是两个正整数, "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(a, n) = 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 则 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为素数当且仅当"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 15, "bbox": [0.378, 0.655, 0.635, 0.671], "content": "(x + a) ^ {n} \\equiv x ^ {n} + a \\bmod n"}, {"type": "text", "index": 16, "bbox": [0.118, 0.689, 0.64, 0.707], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "证明 设 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "C_n^r"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 表示 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 中取 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "r"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的组合数，由二项式定理有"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 17, "bbox": [0.388, 0.718, 0.629, 0.755], "content": "(x + a) ^ {n} = \\sum_ {r = 0} ^ {n} C _ {n} ^ {r} x ^ {r} a ^ {n - r}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 18, "bbox": [0.075, 0.76, 0.942, 0.878], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "当 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为素数时, 对任意 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "r (1 \\leqslant r \\leqslant n - 1)"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 均有 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(r, n) = 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 故 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(r!, n) = ((n - r)!, n) = 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。注意到 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "C_{n}^{r} = \\frac{n!}{r!(n - r)!}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 于是 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n! = C_{n}^{r} r!(n - r)!"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 从而 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n \\mid C_{n}^{r} r!(n - r)!"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 故 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n \\mid C_{n}^{r}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 即 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "C_{n}^{r} \\equiv 0 \\bmod n"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。又由 Fermat 小定理, 当 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(a, n) = 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 时, "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a^{n} \\equiv a \\bmod n"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。从而 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(x + a)^{n} \\equiv x^{n} + a \\bmod n"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 19, "bbox": [0.074, 0.886, 0.942, 0.933], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "反过来,如果 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 不是素数,则 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 必有素因子 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "p < n"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 设 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "p'"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是整除 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的最大次幂, 即 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "p'|n"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "p^{t+1} \\nmid n"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 那么 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "p' \\nmid C_n^p"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 并且 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(p^t, a^{n-p}) = 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 从而 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(x+a)^n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的二项式展开式中 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x^p"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的系数不"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 52, "blocks": [{"type": "page_number", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.085, 0.058, 0.113, 0.07], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "40"}]}, {"type": "header", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.405, 0.055, 0.566, 0.07], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "信息安全数学基础"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.052, 0.09, 0.367, 0.108], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "为0,矛盾！从而n一定是素数。"}], "continues_prev": true}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.051, 0.117, 0.919, 0.217], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定理 1.30 提供了一个素性测试的确定性算法,但该方法不能在多项式时间内完成,主要原因是计算 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "{\\left( x + a\\right) }^{n}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 需要计算 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 个二项式系数。对于充分大的 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "r"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ,计算二项式系数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "{C}_{n}^{r}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是非常困难的。为避免这个难解性问题,一个简单的方法就是在 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "{\\left( x + a\\right) }^{n} \\equiv  {x}^{n} + a"}, {"type": "text", "content": " mod "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的两边同时模去形如 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "{x}^{r} - 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的多项式,其中 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "r"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为一恰当选择的小整数,即有"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.313, 0.225, 0.915, 0.244], "content": "(x + a) ^ {n} \\equiv x ^ {n} + a \\bmod [ n, x ^ {r} - 1 ]\\tag{1.1}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.052, 0.253, 0.921, 0.38], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "显然，n 为素数当且仅当对所有的 a 和 r 均有式(1.1)成立。现在的问题是:对于一些合数 n，它也可能对部分 a 和 r 使得式(1.1)成立。为解决这一问题，AKS 证明了:若对于特定的 r，式(1.1)能够对很多 a 成立的话，则 n 必是素数的方幂，并且 r 的大小和 a 的个数都可以限制在  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\log n"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  的多项式级。从而得到了如下多项式时间的确定性素性测试算法——AKS 算法。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.098, 0.389, 0.663, 0.407], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Step1: 若 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n = a^{b}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 其中 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为正整数, "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "b > 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 则输出 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为合数。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.055, 0.416, 0.92, 0.461], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Step2: 找出最小的正整数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "r"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 使得 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathrm{ord}_{r}(n) > 4(\\log n)^{2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 这里 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathrm{ord}_{r}(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是使得 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n^{k} \\equiv 1 \\mod r"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 成立的最小正整数。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.099, 0.47, 0.633, 0.488], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Step3: 若对某些 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a \\leqslant r, 1 < (a, n) < n"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，则输出 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为合数。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.056, 0.497, 0.921, 0.547], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Step4: 若 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n \\leqslant r"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 则输出 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为素数 (只有当 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 较小时, 才可能发生这种情形, 因为由数论中的结果可以证明, 一定存在 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "r \\leqslant [\\sqrt{16} \\log^5 n]"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 使得 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathrm{ord}_r(n) > 4(\\log n)^2)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.057, 0.558, 0.922, 0.604], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Step5: 对 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 从 1 到 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "[2\\sqrt{\\varphi(r)}\\log n]"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 执行: 如果 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(x + a)^{n} \\equiv x^{n} + a \\bmod n, x^{r} - 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 不成立, 则输出 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是合数, 否则 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是素数。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.056, 0.613, 0.925, 0.795], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "给定一个大整数 n，如何得到 n 的标准分解式，这就是大整数分解问题。相比素性测试问题，大整数分解问题更加困难。当前最有效的三种大整数分解算法是二次筛法、椭圆曲线法和数域筛法，这三个算法都不是多项式时间的算法。椭圆曲线法基于 Pollard 的 p-1 分解法，借助于椭圆曲线上丰富代数结构来分解大整数。二次筛法和数域筛法基于 Dixon 的随机平方法，借助于其他高深的数学工具筛选出随机平方法中所需要的正整数对，从而对大整数进行分解。下面介绍 Pollard 的 p-1 分解法和 Dixon 的随机平方法，这两种分解方法只需要一些简单的数论知识即可。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.057, 0.803, 0.926, 0.93], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Pollard 的 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "p - 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 分解法的基础仍是 Fermat 小定理。假设 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "p"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是待分解的正整数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的一个素因子, 则对于任意正整数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "1 < a < p"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 均有 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "p \\mid (a^{p-1} - 1)"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 从而 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "p \\mid (a^{p-1} - 1, n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 于是对任意正整数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "k"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(p - 1) \\mid k"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 均有 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "p \\mid (a^k - 1, n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。若 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(a^k - 1, n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 不是 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的平凡因子, 则得到 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的一个真因子, 于是可以对 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 进行分解。由于因子 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "p"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 事先并不知道, 但若假设 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "p - 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的所有素因子的幂均小于某个事先选择的整数 "}, {