935, 0.306], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定义2.1 设 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "M"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是一个非空集合, 如果存在一种法则 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 对于 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "M"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 中任意两个元素 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "b"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 按照这种法则都有 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "M"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 中唯一的一个元素 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "c"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 与它们对应, 则称这种法则 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "M"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 中一个代数运算, 记做 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "c = f(a, b)"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 简记为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "c = a \\cdot b"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.065, 0.321, 0.933, 0.422], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "整数的加法、减法、乘法都是整数集合 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathbb{Z}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 中的代数运算, 但除法不是 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathbb{Z}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 中的代数运算。有理数集合 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathbb{Q}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 中的加法、减法、乘法均是 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathbb{Q}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 中的代数运算, 同样, 除法不是 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathbb{Q}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 中的代数运算, 这是因为非零有理数除以 0 没有意义。但如果记 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathbb{Q}^{*}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为全体非零有理数集合, 则 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathbb{Q}^{*}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 中除法是其上的代数运算。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.066, 0.436, 0.933, 0.487], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "例 2.1 设 m 是大于 1 的正整数,  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "Z_{m}=\\{0,1,2,\\cdots,m-1\\}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  表示模 m 的全体剩余类的集合, 对任意  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "i,j \\in Z_{m}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " , 定义"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.348, 0.497, 0.653, 0.519], "content": "\\bar {i} \\oplus \\bar {j} = \\overline {{i + j}} \\quad \\bar {i} \\odot \\bar {j} = \\overline {{i \\cdot j}}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.066, 0.527, 0.81, 0.546], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "其中“+”和“·”为通常数的加法和乘法，则 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\oplus"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\odot"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 均为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathbb{Z}_m"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 中的代数运算。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.067, 0.565, 0.933, 0.612], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "证明 注意到剩余类 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "i"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 中有无穷多个整数, 对每个整数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "s \\in i"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 均有 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\bar{s} = \\bar{i}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。要证明 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\oplus"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\odot"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathbb{Z}_m"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 中的代数运算, 必须说明它们与代表元的选取无关。即如果 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\bar{i} = \\bar{s}, \\bar{j} = \\bar{t}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 则"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.342, 0.622, 0.661, 0.643], "content": "\\bar {i} \\oplus \\bar {j} = \\bar {s} \\oplus \\bar {t} \\quad \\bar {i} \\odot \\bar {j} = \\bar {s} \\odot \\bar {t}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.067, 0.651, 0.934, 0.697], "content"