on_inline", "content": "\\forall a, b \\in G, a \\cdot b \\in G;"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.109, 0.272, 0.624, 0.29], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(2) 结合律: "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\forall a,b,c\\in G,(a\\cdot b)\\cdot c=a\\cdot(b\\cdot c);"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.109, 0.299, 0.624, 0.318], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(3) 有单位元: 存在 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "e \\in G"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 使得对任意 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a \\in G"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 均有"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.409, 0.33, 0.588, 0.344], "content": "e \\cdot a = a \\cdot e = a"}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.11, 0.354, 0.508, 0.373], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(4)有逆元: "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\forall a\\in G"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，存在 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "b\\in G"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，使得"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.41, 0.383, 0.589, 0.399], "content": "a \\cdot b = b \\cdot a = e"}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.066, 0.41, 0.379, 0.428], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "则称 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(G, \\cdot)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为群，简称 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "G"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为群。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.066, 0.445, 0.934, 0.492], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "进一步,如果群 G 中乘法运算还满足交换律:  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\forall a,b\\in G,a\\cdot b=b\\cdot a"}, {"type": "text", "content": " , 则称群 G 为交换群。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 13, "bbox": [0.066, 0.5, 0.933, 0.547], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "整数集 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathbb{Z}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 关于加法运算构成交换群。这是因为两个整数的和仍是整数，封闭律成立。整数的加法显然满足结合律。另外在 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathbb{Z}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 中存在整数0，对任意整数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，均有"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 14, "bbox": [0.403, 0.556, 0.598, 0.573], "content": "a + 0 = 0 + a = a"}, {"type": "text", "index": 15, "bbox": [0.067, 0.583, 0.855, 0.601], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "从而0为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(\\mathbb{Z}, + )"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 中的单位元。对每个整数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a\\in \\mathbb{Z}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，均有其相反数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "-a\\in \\mathbb{Z}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，使得"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 16, "bbox": [0.359, 0.611, 0.645, 0.628], "content": "a + (- a) = (- a) + a = 0"}, {"type": "text", "index": 17, "bbox": [0.068, 0.638, 0.87, 0.657], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "故 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(\\mathbb{Z},+)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 中每个元均有逆元。最后整数的加法满足交换律，故 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(\\mathbb{Z},+)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为交换群。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 18, "bbox": [0.067, 0.665, 0.937, 0.769], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "同样可证有理数集 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathbb{Q}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 、实数集 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathbb{R}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和复数集 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathbb{C}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 关于其中的加法运算均构成交换群。但整数集 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathbb{Z}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 、有理数集 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathbb{Q}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 、实数集 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathbb{R}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和复数集 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathbb{C}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 关于其中的减法、乘法和除法三种运算均不构成群。值得注意的是，非零有理数集 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathbb{Q}^*"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 、非零实数集 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathbb{R}^*"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和非零复数集 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathbb{C}^*"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 关于其中的乘法均构成交换群。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 19, "bbox": [0.069, 0.775, 0.94, 0.853], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "如果 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(G,\\cdot)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为群,则群中单位元及每个元素的逆元都是唯一的。事实上,如果e和 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "e'"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 均为G中单位元,则 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "e=e\\cdot e'=e'"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ,即单位元是唯一的。如果 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "b_{1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "b_{2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 均为a的逆元,则 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a\\cdot b_{1}=b_{1}\\cdot a=e,a\\cdot b_{2}=b_{2}\\cdot a=e"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ,于是有"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 20, "bbox": [0.229, 0.862, 0.78, 0.88], "content": "b _ {1} = b _ {1} \\cdot e = b _ {1} \\cdot (a \\cdot b _ {2}) = (b _ {1} \\cdot a) \\cdot b _ {2} = e \\cdot b _ {2} = b _ {2}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 21, "bbox": [0.071, 0.891, 0.637, 0.909], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "即每个元素的逆元也是唯一的,下面用  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a^{-1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  表示 a 的逆元。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 22, "bbox": [0.115, 0.918, 0.939, 0.937], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "为方便起见,如果群 G 为交换群,则群中运算通常用“+”表示,这时单位元称为零元,"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 62, "blocks": [{"type": "page_number", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.096, 0.059, 0.124, 0.072], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "50"}]}, {"type": "header", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.417, 0.057, 0.578, 0.073], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "信息安全数学基础"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.063, 0.092, 0.587, 0.11], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "逆元称为负元,零元常用0表示,a的