": "(\\mathbb{Z}_{m},\\odot)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为半群。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 15, "bbox": [0.108, 0.581, 0.708, 0.6], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(3) 乘法对加法分配律成立。事实上，对任意 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\bar{i}, \\bar{j}, \\bar{k} \\in \\mathbb{Z}_m"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，有"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 16, "bbox": [0.112, 0.611, 0.876, 0.632], "content": "\\bar {i} \\odot (\\bar {j} \\oplus \\bar {k}) = \\bar {i} \\odot (\\overline {{j + k}}) = \\overline {{i (j + k)}} = \\overline {{i j + i k}} = \\overline {{i j}} \\oplus \\overline {{i k}} = (\\bar {i} \\odot \\bar {j}) \\oplus (\\bar {i} \\odot \\bar {k})"}, {"type": "equation", "index": 17, "bbox": [0.123, 0.639, 0.869, 0.659], "content": "(i \\oplus j) \\odot k = \\overline {{i + j}} \\odot k = \\overline {{(i + j) k}} = \\overline {{i k + j k}} = \\overline {{i k}} \\oplus \\overline {{j k}} = (\\bar {i} \\odot \\bar {k}) \\oplus (\\bar {j} \\odot \\bar {k})"}, {"type": "text", "index": 18, "bbox": [0.063, 0.667, 0.43, 0.686], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "综上所述， "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(\\mathbb{Z}_{m},\\oplus,\\odot)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  构成一个环。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 19, "bbox": [0.065, 0.694, 0.929, 0.74], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "例 2.25 记 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathbb{R}^{n \\times n}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为全体 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 阶实方阵构成的集合, 这里 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为正整数, "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathbb{R}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为实数集, 则 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathbb{R}^{n \\times n}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 关于矩阵方阵的加法与乘法构成一个环。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 20, "bbox": [0.108, 0.756, 0.553, 0.774], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "证明 这由线性代数中矩阵的知识容易验证。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 21, "bbox": [0.063, 0.783, 0.933, 0.911], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "在环的定义中,加法具有良好的性质,即加法满足封闭律、结合律、有零元、有负元和交换律,而乘法只需要满足封闭律和结合律。如果环中乘法还满足更多的性质,则可以得到一些特殊的环,比如若乘法还满足交换律,则称环为交换环。若乘法满足有单位元,则称环为有单位元的环。对于一个有单位元的环而言,如果每个非零元均有乘法逆元,则称该环为体。可交换的体就称为域,这表明域是一类特殊的环。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 22, "bbox": [0.108, 0.918, 0.933, 0.937], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "整数环 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathbb{Z}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 、高斯整数环 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathbb{Z}[i]"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和模 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "m"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的剩余类环 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathbb{Z}_m"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 都是有单位元的交换环。在这三"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 78, "blocks": [{"type": "page_number", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.107, 0.062, 0.134, 0.074], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "66"}]}, {"type": "header", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.427, 0.059, 0.588, 0.075], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "信息安全数学基础"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.071, 0.094, 0.696, 0.112], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "个环中，并非每个非零元有乘法逆元。事实上，已经有如下结论。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.071, 0.128, 0.939, 0.175], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "例 2.26 整数环 Z 中有乘法逆元的元素只有 ±1，高斯整数环 Z[i] 中有乘法逆元的元素只有 ±1，±i，模 m 的剩余类环  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "Z_{m}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  中元素 i 有乘法逆元当且仅当  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(i, m) = 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.071, 0.19, 0.938, 0.236], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "证明 设 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a \\in \\mathbb{Z}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 如果 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 在 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathbb{Z}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 中有乘法逆元, 则存在 "}, {"type": "equation_inl