m 为素数时， "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "Z_{m}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 中每个非零元均有乘法逆元，从而 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "Z_{m}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为域。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.075, 0.551, 0.943, 0.625], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定义 2.9 设 R 是一个环, 若有 R 中非零元 a, b, 使得 ab = 0, 则称 a 为 R 的左零因子, b 为 R 的右零因子。如果环 R 中没有左(右)零因子, 则称 R 为无零因子环, 否则称 R 为有零因子环, 无零因子的交换环叫做整环。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 13, "bbox": [0.119, 0.633, 0.544, 0.651], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "图 2.1 列出了几种主要的环及其相互关系。"}]}, {"type": "image", "index": 14, "bbox": [0.335, 0.66, 0.72, 0.835], "content": [{"type": "image_body", "index": 14, "bbox": [0.335, 0.66, 0.72, 0.835], "content": ""}, {"type": "image_caption", "index": 15, "bbox": [0.382, 0.844, 0.64, 0.86], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "图 2.1 主要环及其相互关系"}]}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 16, "bbox": [0.075, 0.867, 0.945, 0.914], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "由定义易知,整数环 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathbb{Z}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和高斯整数环 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathbb{Z}[i]"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 没有零因子,同时又是交换环,故它们为整环。模 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "m"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的剩余类环 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathbb{Z}_m"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为交换环,它无零因子的充分必要条件是 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "m"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为素数。这是因为如"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 79, "blocks": [{"type": "header", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.414, 0.063, 0.576, 0.078], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "第2章 代数基础"}]}, {"type": "page_number", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.868, 0.065, 0.895, 0.078], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "67"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.06, 0.097, 0.929, 0.171], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "果 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "m"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为合数, 则存在 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "1 < i, j < m"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 使得 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "m = ij"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 于是 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "i \\neq 0, j \\neq 0"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 但 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "i \\odot j = ij = \\bar{m} = \\bar{0}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。当 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n > 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 时, "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 阶矩阵方阵环 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathbb{R}^{n \\times n}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是有零因子的环, 这是因为两个非零矩阵的乘积可能为零矩阵。"}], "continues_prev": true}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.105, 0.179, 0.539, 0.197], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "最后，引入一类应用广泛的环——多项式环。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.105, 0.213, 0.799, 0.231], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定义 2.10 设 R 是有单位元的交换环, x 是一个不定元, 其形式表达式"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.307, 0.242, 0.681, 0.28], "content": "a _ {0} + a _ {1} x + \\dots + a _ {n} x ^ {n} (\\mathrm{简记为} \\sum_ {i = 0} ^ {n} a _ {i} x ^ {i})"}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.062, 0.285, 0.929, 0.33], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(其中 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a_{i} \\in R, n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是非负整数)称为环 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "R"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 上的一个多项式。通常用符号 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f(x), g(x), \\cdots"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 表示多项式，用 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "R[x]"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 表示 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "R"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 上的全体多项式的集合。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.061, 0.34, 0.931, 0.456], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "在多项式 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f(x)=\\sum_{i=0}^{n}a_{i}x^{i}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 中