要介绍组合计数和组合设计等方面的知识,以及这些知识在信息安全领域中的应用。"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 108, "blocks": [{"type": "page_number", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.126, 0.056, 0.154, 0.069], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "96"}]}, {"type": "header", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.447, 0.055, 0.609, 0.07], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "信息安全数学基础"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.092, 0.113, 0.326, 0.136], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "3.1 排列与组合"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.136, 0.171, 0.673, 0.189], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "加法法则和乘法法则是组合计数中最基本的两个法则。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.091, 0.198, 0.96, 0.245], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "加法法则:设事件 A 与事件 B 是两类不同的事件,事件 A 有 m 种产生方式,事件 B 有 n 种产生方式,则“事件 A 或者事件 B”有  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "m+n"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  种产生方式。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.091, 0.253, 0.96, 0.299], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "乘法法则:设事件 A 与事件 B 是两类不同的事件,事件 A 有 m 种产生方式,事件 B 有 n 种产生方式,则“事件 A 与事件 B”有 mn 种产生方式。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.137, 0.315, 0.949, 0.334], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "例 3.1 银行存折的密码通常由 6 位数字组成, 请问猜测一次就猜中的概率是多少?"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.093, 0.35, 0.963, 0.425], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "解 密码的每一位数字的选择都有 10 种可能, 即可以取集合 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\{0,1,2,\\cdots,9\\}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 中的一个数, 每一位数字的选取是互不相关的事件。根据乘法规则, 构造一个密码, 共有 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "10^{6}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 种可能性。所以猜测一次就猜中的概率为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "1 / 10^{6} = 10^{-6}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\square"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.137, 0.44, 0.72, 0.459], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "例 3.2 求比 10 000 小的正整数中含有数字 1 的数的个数。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.094, 0.475, 0.962, 0.521], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "解 比 10 000 小的正整数有 9999 个, 其中不含 1 的正整数有 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "9 \\times 9 \\times 9 \\times 9 - 1 = 6560"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 个, 于是比 10 000 小的正整数中含有数字 1 的个数为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "9999 - 6560 = 3439"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 个。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.094, 0.537, 0.962, 0.584], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定义 3.1 从 n 个不同的元素中, 取 r 个按次序排列, 称为从 n 中取 r 个的排列, 其排列数记为  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "P(n, r)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  (或者  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "P_{n}^{r}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " )。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.093, 0.6, 0.963, 0.646], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定义 3.2 从 n 个不同的元素中，取 r 个而不考虑次序，称为从 n 中取 r 个的组合，其组合数记为  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "C(n, r)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " （或者  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "C_{n}^{r}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ）。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.139, 0.662, 0.451, 0.68], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "例3.3 设 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "A = \\{a, b, c, d\\}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，则"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 13, "bbox": [0.138, 0.689, 0.485, 0.707], "content": [{"type": "equation_inline", "content": "A"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 中元素的所有2个元素的排列为"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 14, "bbox": [0.314, 0.718, 0.738, 0.735], "content": "a b, a c, a d, b a, b c, b d, c a, c b, c d, d a, d b, d c"}, {"type": "text", "index": 15, "bbox": [0.139, 0.745, 0.486, 0.762], "content": [{"type": "equation_inline", "content": "A"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 中元素的所有3个元素的排列为"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 16, "bbox": [0.238, 0.773, 0.805, 0.791], "content": "a b c, a c b, a b d, a d b, a c d, a d c, b a c, b c a, b a d, b d a, b c d, b d c"}, {"type": "equation", "index": 17, "bbox": [0.239, 0.8, 0.812, 0.817], "content": "c a b, c b a, c a d, c d a, c b d, c d b, d a b, d b a, d a c, d c a, d b c, d c b"}, {"type": "text", "index": 18, "bbox": [0.138, 0.826, 0.486, 0.844], "content": [{"type": "equation_inline", "content": "A"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 中元素的所有2个元素的组合为"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 19, "bbox": [0.329, 0.854, 0.736, 0.872], "content": "\\{a, b \\}, \\{a, c \\}, \\{a, d \\}, \\{b, c \\}, \\{b, d \\}, \\{c, d \\}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 20, "bbox": [0.139, 0.881, 0.486, 0.899], "content": [{"type": "equation_inline", "content": "A"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 中元素的所有3个元素的组合为"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 21, "bbox": [0.351, 0.908, 0.702, 0.927], "content": "\\{a, b, c \\}, \\{a, b, d \\}, \\{a, c, d \\}, \\{b, c, d \\}"}]}, {"page_idx": 109, "blocks": [{"type": "header", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.398, 0.058, 0.561, 0.074], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "第3章 组合数学"}]}, {"type": "page_number", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.852, 0.061, 0.881, 0.074], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "97"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.047, 0.094, 0.915, 0.166], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "解 在构造 n 个元素的 r 个元素的排列时, 第一个元素的选取有 n 种方法, 第二个元素的选取有 n-1 种方法,……, 第 r 个元素的选取有  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n-(r-1)=n-r+1"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  种方法。由乘法法则, 从 n 中取 r 个的排列的总数为"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.31, 0.176, 0.651, 0.208], "content": "n (n - 1) \\dots (n - r + 1) = \\frac {n !}{(n - r) !}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.048, 0.219, 0.36, 0.251], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "也就是说， "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "P(n,r)=\\frac{n!}{(n-r)!}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.046, 0.26, 0.915, 0.307], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "特别地,当 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "r = n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 时, "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "P(n,n) = n \\cdot (n-1)\\cdots 2 \\cdot 1 = n!"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 这时称 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 中取 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 个的排列为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 级全排列, "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 级全排列的个数为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "P(n,n) = n!"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.047, 0.315, 0.916, 0.361], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "如果首先做出 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 个元素的所有 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "r"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 个元素组合, 然后对每一个组合, 做出它的全部 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "r"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 级排列, 同样可以得到 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 个不同元素的所有 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "r"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 级排列。由乘法法则有"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.354, 0.368, 0.608, 0.387], "content": "P (n, r) = C (n, r) P (r, r)"}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.049, 0.395, 0.105, 0.414], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "从而"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.319, 0.423, 0.643, 0.457], "content": "C (n, r) = \\frac {P (n , r)}{P (r , r)} = \\frac {n !}{r ! (n - r) !}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.048, 0.466, 0.918, 0.539], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "从 n 中取 r 个的排列的典型模型是把 n 个有标志的球, 取出 r 个放到 r 个有区别的盒子里, 每盒一个。从 n 中取 r 个的组合的典型模型是把 n 个有标志的球, 取出 r 个放到 r 个无区别的盒子里, 每盒一个。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.049, 0.554, 0.917, 0.6], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "例 3.4 从 1~300 之间任取 3 个不同的数, 使得这 3 个数的和正好被 3 整除, 问共有多少种不同方案?"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.092, 0.615, 0.806, 0.634], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "解 由带余除法,每一个整数被3除的余数只能是0,1,2三者之一,故令"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 13, "bbox": [0.286, 0.641, 0.669, 0.716], "content": "\\begin{array}{l} A = \\{x \\mid 1 \\leqslant x \\leqslant 3 0 0, x \\equiv 0 \\bmod 3 \\} \\\\ B = \\{x \\mid 1 \\leqslant x \\leqslant 3 0 0, x \\equiv 1 \\bmod 3 \\} \\\\ C = \\{x \\mid 1 \\leqslant x \\leqslant 3 0 0, x \\equiv 2 \\bmod 3 \\} \\end{array}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 14, "bbox": [0.049, 0.723, 0.918, 0.769], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "则  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\{1,2,3,\\cdots,300\\}=A\\cup B\\cup C,\\quad A,B,C"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  两两互不相交，并且  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "|A|=|B|=|C|=100"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。\n在  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\{1,2,3,\\cdots,300\\}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  中任取 3 个数，其和被 3 整除，只有如下四种情况:"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 15, "bbox": [0.094, 0.778, 0.584, 0.796], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(1) 3个数同属于集合A，应有C(100,3)种方案；"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 16, "bbox": [0.095, 0.805, 0.584, 0.823], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(2) 3个数同属于集合 B，应有 C(100,3) 种方案；"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 17, "bbox": [0.095, 0.832, 0.584, 0.851], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(3) 3个数同属于集合 C，应有 C(100,3) 种方案；"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 18, "bbox": [0.095, 0.859, 0.685, 0.877], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(4) 3个数分属于A,B,C,应有 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "C_{100}^{1}C_{100}^{1}C_{100}^{1}=100^{3}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 种方案。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 19, "bbox": [0.095, 0.886, 0.915, 0.905], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "根据加法法则,共有  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "3C(100,3)+100^{3}=485\\ 100+1\\ 000\\ 000=1\\ 485\\ 100"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  种方案。"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 110, "blocks": [{"type": "page_number", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.111, 0.055, 0.139, 0.067], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "98"}]}, {"type": "header", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.432, 0.053, 0.592, 0.068], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "信息安全数学基础"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.121, 0.087, 0.548, 0.105], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "例3.5 求能整除19600的正整数的个数。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.122, 0.122, 0.888, 0.139], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "解 由于 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "19600 = 2^{4} \\cdot 5^{2} \\cdot 7^{2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 故能整除 19600 的正整数应具有如下形式, 即"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.45, 0.149, 0.567, 0.166], "content": "2 ^ {l} \\cdot 5 ^ {m} \\cdot 7 ^ {n}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.076, 0.177, 0.944, 0.223], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "其中 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "0 \\leqslant l \\leqslant 4, 0 \\leqslant m \\leqslant 2, 0 \\leqslant n \\leqslant 2"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。也就是说 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "l"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 有5种选取方法，"}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "m"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 均有3种选取方法。由乘法法则，能整除19600的正整数的个数应为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "5 \\times 3 \\times 3 = 45"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.077, 0.232, 0.945, 0.306], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "例 3.6 一场音乐会的票价为 50 元一张, 排队买票的顾客中有 m 位持有 50 元的钞票, n 位持有 100 元的钞票。售票处没有准备 50 元的零钱, 问有多少种排队方法使得购票能顺利进行, 即不出现找不出零钱的状态。假定每位顾客限买一张票, 而且 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "m \\geqslant n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.076, 0.321, 0.946, 0.396], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "解 每一种排队方式可以用一列由 m 个 0, n 个 1 的字符串来表示, 其中  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a_{i}=0"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  表示第 i 位顾客持有 50 元的钞票,  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a_{i}=1"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  表示第 i 位顾客持有 100 元的钞票。问题变成有多少个不同字符串  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a_{1}a_{2}\\cdots a_{m+n}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " , 其任意前 k 个字符串, 0 的个数不少于 1 的个数。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.076, 0.405, 0.947, 0.701], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "由 m 个 0 和 n 个 1 构成的字符串的总数为  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "C(m+n, m)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。如果字符串  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a_{1}a_{2}\\cdots a_{m+n}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  中存在某个前缀，该前缀中 1 的个数多于 0 的个数。令 k 是这种前缀的最小下标，则 k 必为奇数，并且  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a_{1}a_{2}\\cdots a_{k}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  中 1 的个数比 0 的个数恰好多 1。如果只将该前缀中 0 变为 1, 1 变为 0，而保持字符串  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a_{1}a_{2}\\cdots a_{m+n}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  中其他部分不变，则得到一个具有  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "m+1"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  个 0、n-1 个 1 的字符串。反过来，任意给定一个具有  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "m+1"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  个 0、n-1 个 1 的字符串，必有一个前缀，其 0 的个数多于 1 的个数。令 k 是最小的下标，使得  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a_{1}a_{2}\\cdots a_{k}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  中 0 的个数多于 1 的个数，显然这时  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a_{1}a_{2}\\cdots a_{k}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  中 0 的个数比 1 的个数多 1，将  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a_{1}a_{2}\\cdots a_{k}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  中 0 变为 1, 1 变为 0，则得到一个新字符串，其中有 m 个 0, n 个 1，并且具有某个前缀，0 的个数比 1 的个数多。这说明不符合要求的字符串与具有  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "m+1"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  个 0、n-1 个 1 的字符串之间可建立一一对应关系，故不符合要求的字符串的个数为  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\begin{bmatrix} m+n \\\\ m+1 \\end{bmatrix}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，从而符合要求的字符串个数为"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.112, 0.709, 0.866, 0.755], "content": "\\left[ \\begin{array}{c} m + n \\\\ m \\end{array} \\right] - \\left[ \\begin{array}{c} m + n \\\\ m + 1 \\end{array} \\right] = \\frac {(m + n) !}{m ! n !} - \\frac {(m + n) !}{(m + 1) ! (n - 1) !} = \\frac {(m - n + 1) (m + n) !}{(m + 1) ! n !}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.123, 0.762, 0.576, 0.779], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定理 3.1 组合数  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "C(n, r)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  具有如下基本性质:"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.124, 0.79, 0.392, 0.806], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(1) "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "C(n,r) = C(n,n - r)"}, {"type": "text", "content": ";"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.124, 0.817, 0.563, 0.833], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(2) "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "C(n,r)=C(n-1,r)+C(n-1,r-1);"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 13, "bbox": [0.124, 0.843, 0.909, 0.888], "content": "\\begin{array}{r l} (3) C (n + r + 1, r) & = C (n + r, r) + C (n + r - 1, r - 1) + C (n + r - 2, r - 2) + \\\\ & \\dots + C (n + 1, 1) + C (n, 0). \\end{array}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 14, "bbox": [0.123, 0.906, 0.946, 0.924], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "证明 (1)从 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 个不同元素 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a_1, a_2, \\dots, a_n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 中取出 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "r"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 个元素，余下元素的个数为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n - r"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，这"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 111, "blocks": [{"type": "header", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.408, 0.063, 0.571, 0.078], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "第3章 组合数学"}]}, {"type": "page_number", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.862, 0.065, 0.89, 0.077], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "99"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.055, 0.098, 0.923, 0.143], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "表明从 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 个元素中取 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "r"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 个元素的组合与从 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 个元素中取 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n - r"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 个元素的组合是一一对应的, 故 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "C(n, r) = C(n, n - r)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}], "continues_prev": true}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.055, 0.152, 0.925, 0.226], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(2) 从 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 个不同元素 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a_{1}, a_{2}, \\cdots, a_{n}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 中取 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "r"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 个元素的组合的全体, 可以分为两类不相交集合, 一类是含有 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a_{1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的组合, 另一类是不含 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a_{1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的组合, 含有 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a_{1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "r"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 个元素的组合有 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "C(n-1, r-1)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 个, 不含 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a_{1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "r"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 个元素的组合有 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "C(n-1, r)"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 于是有"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.288, 0.235, 0.684, 0.252], "content": "C (n, r) = C (n - 1, r) + C (n - 1, r - 1)"}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.055, 0.262, 0.926, 0.393], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(3)由等式(2)反复递推下去容易得到证明结果。其组合的意义在于:从 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n+r+1"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 个不同元素 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a_{1},a_{2},\\cdots,a_{n+r+1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 中取r个元素的组合的全体,根据是否含有 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a_{1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 分为两类,其中不含 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a_{1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的组合有 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "C(n+r,r)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 个。而含有 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a_{1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的r个元素的组合,再根据是否含有 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a_{2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 分为两大类,其中含有 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a_{1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 不含 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a_{2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的r个元素的组合有 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "C(n+r-1,r-1)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 个;含有 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a_{1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a_{2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的r个元素的组合再根据是否含有 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a_{3}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 分为两大类,……,依次下去便得到公式。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.056, 0.401, 0.927, 0.502], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "以上所讨论的排列和组合是不允许元素重复选取的,这样的排列与组合称为不允许重复的排列与组合,或者不可重排列与组合。否则称为允许重复的排列与组合,或者称为可重排列与组合。允许重复的排列与组合根据重复是否有限制又可分为允许重复并且重复无限制的排列与组合,以及允许重复并且重复有限制的排列与组合。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.057, 0.51, 0.926, 0.556], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "下面讨论允许重复并且重复无限制的排列与组合的计数问题,关于允许重复并且重复有限制的排列与组合的计数问题,则需要用母函数作为工具加以解决。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.101, 0.572, 0.774, 0.589], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "例3.7 设 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "A = \\{a, b, c\\}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，则 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "A"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 中元素的所有可重2个元素的排列为"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.314, 0.601, 0.662, 0.617], "content": "a a, a b, a c, b a, b b, b c, c a, c b, c c"}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.101, 0.627, 0.493, 0.645], "content": [{"type": "equation_inline", "content": "A"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 中元素的所有可重3个元素的排列为"}]}, {"type": "eq