 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x^{2} - x - 1 = 0"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，特征根为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\alpha_{1} = \\frac{1 + \\sqrt{5}}{2}, \\alpha_{2} = \\frac{1 - \\sqrt{5}}{2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.112, 0.369, 0.45, 0.387], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "引理 3.1 对于齐次线性递推关系"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.271, 0.397, 0.729, 0.415], "content": "a _ {n} + c _ {1} a _ {n - 1} + c _ {2} a _ {n - 2} + \\dots + c _ {k} a _ {n - k} = 0, c _ {k} \\neq 0"}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.065, 0.424, 0.898, 0.442], "content": [{"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a_{n} = \\alpha^{n}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " （"}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\alpha"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为非零复数）是递推关系的一个解当且仅当 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\alpha"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是该递推关系的一个特征根。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.11, 0.459, 0.737, 0.477], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "证明 （必要性）如果 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a_{n} = \\alpha^{n}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为齐次线性递推关系的一个解，则"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.313, 0.487, 0.686, 0.505], "content": "\\alpha^ {n} + c _ {1} \\alpha^ {n - 1} + c _ {2} \\alpha^ {n - 2} + \\dots + c _ {k} \\alpha^ {n - k} = 0"}, {"type": "text", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.068, 0.514, 0.098, 0.531], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "即"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 13, "bbox": [0.304, 0.541, 0.695, 0.559], "content": "\\alpha^ {n - k} (\\alpha^ {k} + c _ {1} \\alpha^ {k - 1} + c _ {2} \\alpha^ {k - 2} + \\dots + c _ {k}) = 0"}, {"type": "text", "index": 14, "bbox": [0.067, 0.569, 0.929, 0.588], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "注意到 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\alpha \\neq 0"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，故 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\alpha^k + c_1\\alpha^{k - 1} + c_2\\alpha^{k - 2} + \\dots +c_k = 0"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，这表明 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\alpha"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是递推关系的一个特征根。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 15, "bbox": [0.067, 0.597, 0.932, 0.644], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "（充分性）如果  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\alpha"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  是递推关系的一个特征根，则  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\alpha^{k} + c_{1}\\alpha^{k-1} + c_{2}\\alpha^{k-2} + \\cdots + c_{k} = 0"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，两边同乘以  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\alpha^{n-k}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  得  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\alpha^{n} + c_{1}\\alpha^{n-1} + c_{2}\\alpha^{n-2} + \\cdots + c_{k}\\alpha^{n-k} = 0"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，即  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\alpha^{n}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  是该递推关系的一个解。☐"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 16, "bbox": [0.066, 0.653, 0.932, 0.699], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "引理 3.2 如果 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a_{n}, b_{n}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 均为齐次线性递推关系 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a_{n} + c_{1}a_{n-1} + c_{2}a_{n-2} + \\cdots + c_{k}a_{n-k} = 0"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的解, 则对任意复数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "A_{1}, A_{2}, A_{1}a_{n} + A_{2}b_{n}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 也是该递推关系的一个解。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 17, "bbox": [0.111, 0.715, 0.278, 0.732], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "证明 由条件知"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 18, "bbox": [0.311, 0.742, 0.72, 0.789], "content": "\\begin{array}{l} a _ {n} + c _ {1} a _ {n - 1} + c _ {2} a _ {n - 2} + \\dots + c _ {k} a _ {n - k} = 0 \\\\ b _ {n} + c _ {1} b _ {n - 1} + c _ {2} b _ {n - 2} + \\dots + c _ {k} b _ {n - k} = 0 \\end{array}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 19, "bbox": [0.068, 0.797, 0.121, 0.814], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "从而"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 20, 