, "content": "a _ {n} = \\left(\\frac {7}{9} - \\frac {1}{3} n\\right) (- 1) ^ {n} + \\frac {2}{9} 2 ^ {n}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 13, "bbox": [0.05, 0.513, 0.919, 0.561], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "上面已经介绍了如何求解齐次线性递推关系,对于求解非齐次线性递推关系,甫键问题是如何得到非齐次线性递推关系的一个特解。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 14, "bbox": [0.051, 0.575, 0.919, 0.622], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定理 3.8 非齐次线性递推关系的一般解可以表示其一个特解与相应齐次线性递推关系的一般解的和。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 15, "bbox": [0.051, 0.637, 0.921, 0.685], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "证明 设 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a_{n}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为非齐次线性递推关系的一个特解, "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "b_{n}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为相应齐次线性递推关系的一般解, 则"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 16, "bbox": [0.278, 0.693, 0.692, 0.74], "content": "\\begin{array}{c} a _ {n} + c _ {1} a _ {n - 1} + c _ {2} a _ {n - 2} + \\dots + c _ {k} a _ {n - k} = f (n) \\\\ b _ {n} + c _ {1} b _ {n - 1} + c _ {2} b _ {n - 2} + \\dots + c _ {k} b _ {n - k} = 0 \\end{array}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 17, "bbox": [0.054, 0.749, 0.128, 0.766], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "从而有"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 18, "bbox": [0.118, 0.775, 0.855, 0.794], "content": "(a _ {n} + b _ {n}) + c _ {1} (a _ {n - 1} + b _ {n - 1}) + c _ {2} (a _ {n - 2} + b _ {n - 2}) + \\dots + c _ {k} (a _ {n - k} + b _ {n - k}) = f (n)"}, {"type": "text", "index": 19, "bbox": [0.053, 0.804, 0.442, 0.822], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "故 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a_{n} + b_{n}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为非齐次线性递推关系的解。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 20, "bbox": [0.097, 0.831, 0.638, 0.85], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "另一方面,如果  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a_{n}^{*}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  为非齐次线性递推关系的任意解,则"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 21, "bbox": [0.276, 0.859, 0.696, 0.879], "content": "a _ {n} ^ {*} + c _ {1} a _ {n - 1} ^ {*} + c _ {2} a _ {n - 2} ^ {*} + \\dots + c _ {k} a _ {n - k} ^ {*} = f (n)"}, {"type": "text", "index": 22, "bbox": [0.055, 0.888, 0.132, 0.905], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "从而有"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 23, "bbox": [0.216, 0.915, 0.762, 0.934], "content": "(a _ {n} ^ {*} - a _ {n}) + c _ {1} (a _ {n - 1} ^ {*} - a _ {n - 1}) + \\dots + c _ {k} (a _ {n - k} ^ {*} - a _ {n - k}) = 0"}]}, {"page_idx": 130, "blocks": [{"type": "page_number", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.107, 0.057, 0.143, 0.07], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "118"}]}, {"type": "header", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.427, 0.056, 0.588, 0.071], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "信息安全数学基础"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.072, 0.091, 0.941, 0.136], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "即 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a_{n}^{*} - a_{n}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为相应的齐次线性递推关系的一个解, 所以 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a_{n}^{*}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 可以表示为非齐次线性递推关系式的一个特解与相应的齐次线性递推关系的解之和。 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\square"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.072, 0.145, 0.941, 0.296], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "对于齐次线性递推关系 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f_{n} = f_{n - 1} + f_{n - 2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 而言, 其特征方程为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x^{2} - x - 1 = 0"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 特征根为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\alpha_{1} = \\frac{1 + \\sqrt{5}}{2}, \\alpha_{2} = \\frac{1 - \\sqrt{5}}{2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。从而由定理3.5可得 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f_{n} = A\\left(\\frac{1 + \\sqrt{5}}{2}\\right)^{n} + B\\left(\\frac{1 - \\sqrt{5}}{2}\\right)^{n}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。对于非齐次线性递推关系 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "h_{n} = 2h_{n - 1} + 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 而言, 它的一个特解显然为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "h_{n} = -1"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 而相应的齐次线性递推关系 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "h_{n} = 2h_{n - 1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的一般解为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "h_{n} = A2^{n}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 从而由定理3.7, "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "h_{n} = 2h_{n - 1} + 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的一般解为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "h_{n} = A2^{n} - 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.073, 0.303, 0.941, 0.35], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "对于一般的非齐次线性递推关系,求特解是一个较为困难的问题,没有较系统的方法,应根据不同情况进行处理。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.117, 0.366, 0.514, 0.383], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "例 3.29 求解下列非齐次线性递推关系"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.408, 0.393, 0.598, 0.44], "content": "\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l} a _ {n} = 2 a _ {n - 1} + 4 ^ {n - 1} \\\\ a _ {0} = 1 \\end{array} \\right."}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.074, 0.455, 0.941, 0.528], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "解 该递推关系的特征方程为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x - 2 = 0"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，特征根只有 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\alpha = 2"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，从而相应的齐次线性递推关系的一般解为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "A2^n"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。注意到 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f(n) = 4^{n-1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，可令 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a_n = 2a_{n-1} + 4^{n-1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的特解为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "B4^{n-1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，代入递推关系可得"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.316, 0.537, 0.699, 0.571], "content": "B 4 ^ {n - 1} = 2 B 4 ^ {n - 2} + 4 ^ {n - 1} = \\left(\\frac {B}{2} + 1\\right) 4 ^ {n - 1}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.074, 0.583, 0.939, 0.655], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "于是 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "B = \\frac{B}{2} + 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，求得 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "B = 2"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，即 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "2 \\cdot 4^{n-1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为非齐次线性递推关系的一个特解，从而 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a_n = A2^n + 2 \\cdot 4^{n-1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为递推关系的一般解。再由初值条件可得到 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "A = \\frac{1}{2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，故"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.331, 0.668, 0.683, 0.7], "content": "a _ {n} = \\frac {1}{2} 2 ^ {n} + 2 \\cdot 4 ^ {n - 1} = \\frac {1}{2} (2 ^ {n} + 4 ^ {n})"}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.118, 0.711, 0.703, 0.729], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "例3.30 求 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 位十进制数中出现偶数个5的正整数的个数。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.075, 0.746, 0.941, 0.791], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "解 设 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a_{n}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 位十进制数中出现偶数个5的正整数的个数, "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "b_{n}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 位十进制数中出现奇数个5的正整数的个数, 则"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 13, "bbox": [0.415, 0.801, 0.602, 0.875], "content": "\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l} a _ {n} = 9 a _ {n - 1} + b _ {n - 1} \\\\ b _ {n} = 9 b _ {n - 1} + a _ {n - 1} \\\\ a _ {1} = 8, b _ {1} = 1 \\end{array} \\right."}, {"type": "text", "index": 14, "bbox": [0.075, 0.883, 0.939, 0.928], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "设序列  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a_{0}, a_{1}, a_{2}, \\cdots"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  和  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "b_{0}, b_{1}, b_{2}, \\cdots"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  的母函数分别为  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "A(x), B(x)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，由  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a_{n} = 9a_{n-1} + b_{n-1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  可得"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 131, "blocks": [{"type": "header", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.413, 0.063, 0.575, 0.078], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "第3章 组合数学"}]}, {"type": "page_number", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.856, 0.065, 0.894, 0.078], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "119"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.346, 0.098, 0.646, 0.115], "content": "(1 - 9 x) A (x) - x B (x) = 8 x"}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.063, 0.125, 0.313, 0.143], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "由 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "b_{n} = 9b_{n - 1} + a_{n - 1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 可得"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.351, 0.153, 0.64, 0.17], "content": "(1 - 9 x) B (x) - x A (x) = x"}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.062, 0.18, 0.093, 0.197], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "故"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.278, 0.206, 0.65, 0.254], "content": "\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l} (1 - 9 x) A (x) - x B (x) = 8 x \\\\ (1 - 9 x) B (x) - x A (x) = x \\end{array} \\right."}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.062, 0.261, 0.16, 0.279], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "由此解得"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.345, 0.289, 0.641, 0.367], "content": "\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l} A (x) = \\frac {- 7 1 x ^ {2} + 8 x}{(1 - 8 x) (1 - 1 0 x)} \\\\ B (x) = \\frac {- x ^ {2} + x}{(1 - 8 x) (1 - 1 0 x)} \\end{array} \\right."}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.062, 0.376, 0.138, 0.394], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "从而有"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.08, 0.403, 0.904, 0.44], "content": "A (x) = \\frac {- 7 1 x ^ {2} + 8 x}{(1 - 8 x) (1 - 1 0 x)} = \\frac {x}{2} \\left(\\frac {7}{1 - 8 x} + \\frac {9}{1 - 1 0 x}\\right) = \\frac {1}{2} \\left(\\sum_ {n = 0} ^ {\\infty} 7 \\cdot 8 ^ {n} + 9 \\cdot 1 0 ^ {n}\\right) x ^ {n + 1}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.063, 0.447, 0.116, 0.465], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "于是"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.258, 0.476, 0.729, 0.508], "content": "a _ {n} = \\frac {1}{2} (7 \\cdot 8 ^ {n - 1} + 9 \\cdot 1 0 ^ {n - 1}) \\quad n = 1, 2, 3, \\dots"}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 13, "bbox": [0.062, 0.547, 0.263, 0.569], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "3.5 区组设计"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 14, "bbox": [0.061, 0.607, 0.93, 0.682], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "区组设计属于组合设计的范畴,它与实验设计、纠错编码等密切相关。本节介绍区组设计方面的基本知识,包括拉丁方、正交拉丁方、平衡不完全区组设计和 Hadamard 矩阵等。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 15, "bbox": [0.062, 0.697, 0.93, 0.744], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "例 3.31(品种优劣比较) 在一块试验田中试种 3 种新型水稻品种 A, B, C, 以便比较品种的优劣。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 16, "bbox": [0.104, 0.751, 0.864, 0.77], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "解 为了消除土地纵向和横向肥瘠不均的影响,将实验田分为9块,种法如下:"}]}, {"type": "table", "index": 17, "bbox": [0.402, 0.778, 0.589, 0.892], "content": [{"type": "table_body", "index": 17, "bbox": [0.402, 0.778, 0.589, 0.892], "content": "<table><tr><td>A</td><td>B</td><td>C</td></tr><tr><td>B</td><td>C</td><td>A</td></tr><tr><td>C</td><td>A</td><td>B</td></tr></table>"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 18, "bbox": [0.061, 0.917, 0.928, 0.937], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "即每个品种在每行每列各出现一次。通过比较各个品种的平均产量就可以知道品种的优劣。"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 132, "blocks": [{"type": "page_number", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.094, 0.059, 0.132, 0.072], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "120"}]}, {"type": "header", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.414, 0.058, 0.575, 0.073], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "信息安全数学基础"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.062, 0.092, 0.928, 0.138], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定义 3.6 设 A 是  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n \\times n"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  矩阵, 如果 A 的每行每列都是  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\{1, 2, \\cdots, n\\}"}, {"type": "text", "