equation", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.21, 0.242, 0.774, 0.289], "content": "\\begin{array}{r l} H (X _ {1} X _ {2} \\dots X _ {N} S) & = H (X _ {1} X _ {2} \\dots X _ {N}) + H (S \\mid X _ {1} X _ {2} \\dots X _ {N}) \\\\ & = H (S) + H (X _ {1} X _ {2} \\dots X _ {N} \\mid S) \\end{array}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.059, 0.299, 0.113, 0.317], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "所以"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.158, 0.325, 0.828, 0.401], "content": "\\begin{array}{r l} H (X _ {1} X _ {2} \\dots X _ {N}) & = H (S) + H (X _ {1} X _ {2} \\dots X _ {N} \\mid S) - H (S \\mid X _ {1} X _ {2} \\dots X _ {N}) \\\\ & = H (S) - H (S \\mid X _ {1} X _ {2} \\dots X _ {N}) + H (X _ {1} X _ {2} \\dots X _ {N} \\mid S) \\\\ & 0 \\leqslant H (S \\mid X _ {1} X _ {2} \\dots X _ {N}) \\leqslant H (S) \\leqslant \\log J \\end{array}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.06, 0.41, 0.405, 0.428], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "于是马尔可夫信源的平均符号熵为"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.175, 0.438, 0.814, 0.513], "content": "\\begin{array}{r l} H _ {N} (X) & = \\frac {1}{N} H (X _ {1} X _ {2} \\dots X _ {N}) \\\\ & = \\frac {1}{N} [ H (S) - H (S \\mid X _ {1} X _ {2} \\dots X _ {N}) + H (X _ {1} X _ {2} \\dots X _ {N} \\mid S) ] \\end{array}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.06, 0.526, 0.36, 0.544], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "一般马尔可夫信源的极限熵有"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.146, 0.552, 0.925, 0.664], "content": "\\begin{array}{r l} H _ {\\infty} & = H _ {\\infty} (X) = \\lim _ {N \\to \\infty} H _ {N} (X) \\\\ & = \\lim _ {N \\to \\infty} \\frac {1}{N} [ H (S) - H (S \\mid X _ {1} X _ {2} \\dots X _ {N}) ] + \\lim _ {N \\to \\infty} \\frac {1}{N} H (X _ {1} X _ {2} \\dots X _ {N} \\mid S) \\\\ & H _ {\\infty} = H _ {\\infty} (X) = \\lim _ {N \\to \\infty} \\frac {1}{N} H (X _ {1} X _ {2} \\dots X _ {N} \\mid S) \\end{array}\\tag{4.3}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 13, "bbox": [0.063, 0.677, 0.138,