[ q _ {3}, (1, L), (0, S) ] \\\\ \\delta (q _ {4}, 0, 1) = [ q _ {3}, (0, L), (1, S) ] \\\\ \\delta (q _ {4}, 0, 0) = [ q _ {3}, (0, L), (0, S) ] \\\\ \\delta (q _ {4}, 0, b) = [ q _ {5}, (0, S), (b, S) ] \\\\ \\delta (q _ {4}, 1, b) = [ q _ {5}, (1, S), (b, S) ] \\end{array}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.107, 0.422, 0.506, 0.441], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "图灵机的工作过程可以用格局序列描述。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.062, 0.457, 0.931, 0.559], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定义 5.10 一台图灵机 M 的某一格局是一个 k 元组  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(a_{1}, a_{2}, \\cdots, a_{k})"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，其中  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a_{i}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  是一个形如 xqy 的字符串，这里 q 是 M 的当前状态，xy 是在当前状态 q 下第 i 条带上的符号串（不计右端空白符），第 i 个带头指向 y 的第一个符号，当 y 为空串时，第 i 个带头指向空白符。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.063, 0.567, 0.931, 0.613], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "如果图灵机计算一步后,它的格局由  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "D_{1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  变成了  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "D_{2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " , 就记做  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "D_{1} \\rightarrow D_{2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  (读做“进入”), 对于  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n \\geqslant 2"}, {"type": "text", "content": " , 如果有"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.391, 0.621, 0.602, 0.639], "content": "D _ {1} \\rightarrow D _ {2} \\rightarrow \\dots \\rightarrow D _ {n}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.064, 0.648, 0.142, 0.666], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "就记做"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.442, 0.678, 0.555, 0.701], "content": "D _ {1} \\xrightarrow {*} D _ {n}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.063, 0.71, 0.928, 0.755], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "如果对于某一 k 元组  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(a_{1}, a_{2}, \\cdots, a_{k})"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  和某一输入串  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "c_{1}c_{2}\\cdots c_{n}, c_{i} \\in I, i = 1, 2, \\cdots, k"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，有"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 13, "bbox": [0.286, 0.767, 0.709, 0.791], "content": "(q _ {0} c _ {1} c _ {2} \\dots c _ {n}, q _ {0}, \\dots , q _ {0}) \\stackrel {*} {\\longrightarrow} (a _ {1}, a _ {2}, \\dots , a _ {k})"}, {"type": "text", "index": 14, "bbox": [0.064, 0.801, 0.713, 0.819], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "并且 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "q_{f}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 在 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(a_{1},a_{2},\\cdots,a_{k})"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 中间，则称图灵机M接收输入串 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "c_{1}c_{2}\\cdots c_{n}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 15, "bbox": [0.064, 0.835, 0.934, 0.91], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "例 5.6 对于表 5.1 定义的图灵机, 假定输入带 1 的符号串为 0110 , 图灵机初始状态为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "{q}_{0}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。它识别这个符号串的格局序列记录在图 5.2 中, 因为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "{q}_{5}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是接收状态, 所以该图灵机接收符号串 0110。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 16, "bbox": [0.109, 0.918, 0.61, 0.937], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "图灵机识别字符串0110的格局序列如图5.2所示。"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 208, "blocks": [{"type": "page_number", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.08, 0.061, 0.117, 0.074], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "196"}]}, {"type": "header", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.4, 0.059, 0.562, 0.075], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "信息安全数学基础"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.346, 0.1, 0.616, 0.667], "content": "\\begin{array}{r l}(q _ {0} 0 1 1 0, q _ {0})&\\stackrel {*} {\\rightarrow} (q _ {1} 0 1 1 0, \\times q _ {1})\\\\&\\stackrel {*} {\\rightarrow} (0 q _ {1} 1 1 0, \\times 0 q _ {1})\\\\&\\stackrel {*} {\\rightarrow} (0 1 q _ {1} 1 0, \\times 0 1 q _ {1})\\\\&\\stackrel {*} {\\rightarrow} (0 1 1 q _ {1} 0, \\times 0 1 1 q _ {1})\\\\&\\stackrel {*} {\\rightarrow} (0 1 1 0 q _ {1}, \\times 0 1 1 0 q _ {1})\\\\&\\stackrel {*} {\\rightarrow} (0 1 1 0 q _ {2}, \\times 0 1 1 q _ {2} 0)\\\\&\\stackrel {*} {\\rightarrow} (0 1 1 0 q _ {2}, \\times 0 1 q _ {2} 1 0)\\\\&\\stackrel {*} {\\rightarrow} (0 1 1 0 q _ {2}, \\times 0 q _ {2} 1 1 0)\\\\&\\stackrel {*} {\\rightarrow} (0 1 1 0 q _ {2}, \\times q _ {2} 0 1 1 0)\\\\&\\stackrel {*} {\\rightarrow} (0 1 1 0 q _ {2}, q _ {2} \\times 0 1 1 0)\\\\&\\stackrel {*} {\\rightarrow} (0 1 1 q _ {3} 0, \\times q _ {3} 0 1 1 0)\\\\&\\stackrel {*} {\\rightarrow} (0 1 1 q _ {4} 0, \\times 0 q _ {4} 1 1 0)\\\\&\\stackrel {*} {\\rightarrow} (0 1 q _ {3} 1 0, \\times 0 q _ {3} 1 1 0)\\\\&\\stackrel {*} {\\rightarrow} (0 1 q _ {4} 1 0, \\times 0 1 q _ {4} 1 0)\\\\&\\stackrel {*} {\\rightarrow} (0 q _ {3} 1 1 0, \\times 0 1 q _ {3} 1 0)\\\\&\\stackrel {*} {\\rightarrow} (0 q _ {4} 1 1 0, \\times 0 1 1 q _ {4} 0)\\\\&\\stackrel {*} {\\rightarrow} (q _ {3} 0 1 1 0, \\times 0 1 1 q _ {3} 0)\\\\&\\stackrel {*} {\\rightarrow} (q _ {4} 0 1 1 0, \\times 0 1 1 0 q _ {4})\\\\&\\stackrel {*} {\\rightarrow} (q _ {5} 0 1 1 0, \\times 0 1 1 0 q _ {5})\\end{array}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.293, 0.679, 0.675, 0.696], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "图 5.2 图灵机识别字符串 0110 的格局序列"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.051, 0.718, 0.918, 0.764], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定义 5.11 一个确定性图灵机程序的时间复杂性 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "T(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 是它处理所有长度为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的输入所需的最大计算步数。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.05, 0.772, 0.919, 0.818], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "当然,这是最坏情况下的时间复杂性。如果对于某个长度为 n 的输入,图灵机不停机,则  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "T(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  对这个 n 无定义。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.05, 0.833, 0.919, 0.878], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定义 5.12 一个确定性图灵机程序的空间复杂性 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "S(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是处理所有长度为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的输入时, 在 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "k"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 条带上所使用过的方格的总和。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.095, 0.887, 0.656, 0.905], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "如果某个带头无限地向右移动而不停机， "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "S(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  也无定义。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.094, 0.913, 0.919, 0.932], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "若存在一个多项式 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "p"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，使得对所有 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n \\in Z^{+}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，有 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "T(n) \\leqslant p(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，则称程序为一个多项式"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 209, "blocks": [{"type": "header", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.38, 0.054, 0.601, 0.07], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "第 5 章 计算复杂性基础"}]}, {"type": "page_number", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.853, 0.056, 0.891, 0.07], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "197"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.058, 0.089, 0.298, 0.107], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "时间确定性图灵机程序。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.1, 0.123, 0.646, 0.142], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定义 5.13 称满足如下形式化定义的集合为 P 类语言:"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.098, 0.15, 0.882, 0.169], "content": [{"type": "equation_inline", "content": "P = \\{L:"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 存在一个多项式时间DTM程序 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "M"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，使得 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "L"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 能被 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "M"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 识别，即 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "L = L_{M}\\}"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.057, 0.177, 0.926, 0.252], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "类似地,由 5.1 节最后所指出的所有现实的计算模型相对于多项式时间的等价性,这里所给 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "P"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 类语言的定义可以按照适合于任一种现实计算模型的程序去重新描述。因此,以后将不再提及这里所用的确定性图灵机程序,而只说多项式时间算法。"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.057, 0.283, 0.269, 0.305], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "5.3 RAM模型"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.057, 0.34, 0.926, 0.414], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "随机存取机器(RAM)模型是算法分析与计算复杂性理论中重要的串行计算模型,它的运行过程类似于真实计算机的运行过程。因此,它的引进便于从理论上分析计算机串行程序所耗费的时间、空间等资源。一个 RAM 模型主要构成部件包括:"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.057, 0.421, 0.926, 0.468], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(1) 一条只读输入带, 由一系列的方格和带头组成, 每格可以存放一个任意大小的整数。每当读出带头下的符号时, 带头自动右移一个方格。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.058, 0.475, 0.927, 0.549], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(2) 一条只写输出带, 由一系列的方格和带头组成, 每格可以记录一个任意大小的整数。开始时所有方格都为空白, 一旦执行一条指令, 一个整数将打印在带头所对准的方格内, 然后带头右移一个方格。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.059, 0.556, 0.927, 0.602], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(3) 存储器, 由任意多个普通寄存器 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "R_{0}, R_{1}, \\cdots"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 组成, 每个寄存器可以存放一个任意大小的整数。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.06, 0.609, 0.928, 0.655], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(4) 程序控制部件, 用于控制一个程序。按程序的指向和每条指令的严格定义一步步执行。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.106, 0.663, 0.511, 0.682], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(5) 程序存储部件, 用于存储 RAM 程序。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 13, "bbox": [0.105, 0.691, 0.476, 0.709], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "RAM 模型结构示意图如图 5.3 所示。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 14, "bbox": [0.061, 0.717, 0.932, 0.846], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "RAM的指令为下列几种形式: ①A←a, 表示把地址A的内容改为自然数a; ②A←B, 表示把地址A的内容改为地址B的内容; ③A←B*C, 表示把地址A的内容改为地址B中的内容和地址C中的内容做*运算之后的结果。这里的*可以是自然数的加法、减法、乘法或除法。④A←F(B,C), 此处F是一个可以用多带图灵机在多项式空间和对数多项式的巡回(循环轮数)中实现的变换。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 15, "bbox": [0.062, 0.853, 0.933, 0.928], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "RAM 除了可以用以上的指令编程序外, 还可以判断某个寄存器或变址器的内容是否为 0 , 以实现条件转移。变址器是用来实现间接地址的, 所以要求在运算过程中变址器中所存的自然数不大于所用到的普通寄存器数目的某个常数倍。"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 210, "blocks": [{"type": "page_number", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.075, 0.05, 0.113, 0.063], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "198"}]}, {"type": "header", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.394, 0.049, 0.555, 0.064], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "信息安全数学基础"}]}, {"type": "image", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.194, 0.09, 0.755, 0.293], "content": [{"type": "image_body", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.194, 0.09, 0.755, 0.293], "content": ""}, {"type": "image_caption", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.342, 0.303, 0.61, 0.319], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "图 5.3 RAM 模型结构示意图"}]}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.041, 0.336, 0.913, 0.546], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "RAM在执行一个程序的时候,首先指令计数器指向程序的第一条指令,输入带上已有一串输入数据(当这个程序需要输入某些数据时),输入带头对准第一个输入字符 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x_{1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 所在的方格,输出带上全是空白字符,输出带头指向左端第一个空格。当机器执行第 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "k"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 条指令时,如果被执行的指令不是转移指令和停机指令,机器就完成操作码定义的有关操作,然后指令计数器自动加一,指向第 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "k + 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 条指令;当执行的指令是无条件转移指令,则无条件转向这条指令所指定的那条指令(设程序中的指令都是可以加标号的);当执行的指令是条件转移指令,那么如果条件满足,则转向这条指令的操作地址部分的标号指定的那条指令,如果条件不满足,则顺序执行下一条指令;当执行的指令是HALT时就停机。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.043, 0.552, 0.912, 0.653], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "机器执行指令时,就从只读输入带上读入一个数据。当机器执行输出指令时,就在只读输出带上打印结果。当然,一个程序也可能没有输出指令(或者它不需要输出数据;或者它需要的输出在程序中已用直接型指令给出)。一般说来,一个程序至少应有一条输出指令。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.044, 0.66, 0.913, 0.734], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "一般来说,一个 RAM 程序定义了一个从输入信息到输出信息的映射。可以对这种映射关系做很多不同的解释,但最重要的两种解释是:一个 RAM 程序或者计算一个函数,或者识别一个语言。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.044, 0.741, 0.914, 0.842], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "衡量一个算法的好坏可以用 RAM 程序执行所用的时间和内存消耗来衡量。通常 RAM 的资源耗费有两种定义方式, 即均匀耗费和对数耗费。均匀的空间耗费是指计算中曾经使用过的寄存器的总数。均匀的时间耗费是指自始至终被执行的指令和转移的总条数。均匀耗费常用于算法分析中。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.045, 0.849, 0.915, 0.923], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "另一种标准是对数耗费。此时空间耗费指计算中普通寄存器存过的自然数的最大长度之和；时间耗费则指被执行的每条指令的时间耗费之和。而一条指令的时间耗费则被认为与被运算的自然数的长度是成正比的。"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 211, "blocks": [{"type": "header", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.37, 0.056, 0.59, 0.071], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "第5章 计算复杂性基础"}]}, {"type": "page_number", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.844, 0.058, 0.879, 0.07], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "199"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.092, 0.091, 0.629, 0.108], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "下面进一步分析 RAM 与确定性图灵机(DTM)的联系。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.048, 0.125, 0.914, 0.17], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定义 5.14 对于函数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f_{1}(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f_{2}(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 如果存在两个多项式 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "p_{1}(x)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "p_{2}(x)"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 使得除去有限多个 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 值外, 不等式"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.267, 0.179, 0.691, 0.199], "content": "f _ {1} (n) \\leqslant p _ {1} (f _ {2} (n)) \\text {和} f _ {2} (n) \\leqslant p _ {2} (f _ {1} (n))"}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.046, 0.206, 0.525, 0.224], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "成立，则称函数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f_{1}(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f_{2}(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是多项式相关的。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.047, 0.24, 0.912, 0.287], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "例 5.7 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "{f}_{1}\\left( n\\right)  = 2{n}^{2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "{f}_{2}\\left( n\\right)  = {n}^{5}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 就是多项式相关的。这是因为只要令 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "{p}_{1}\\left( x\\right)  ="}, {"type": "text", "content": " "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "{2x},{p}_{2}\\left( x\\right)  = {x}^{3}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ,则对于全部 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n \\geq  0"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ,都有"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.352, 0.295, 0.609, 0.313], "content": "2 n ^ {2} \\leqslant 2 n ^ {5} \\text {和} n ^ {5} \\leqslant (2 n ^ {2}) ^ {3}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.048, 0.322, 0.912, 0.369], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "同样,函数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f_{1}(n) = n\\log_{2}n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f_{2}(n) = 3n^{3}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 也是多项式相关的。只要令 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "p_1(x) = x"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，"}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "p_2(x) = x^3"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，则对于一切 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n \\geqslant 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，有不等式"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.267, 0.377, 0.696, 0.396], "content": "n \\log_ {2} n \\leqslant 3 n ^ {3} \\quad 3 n ^ {3} \\leqslant 3 (n \\log_ {2} n) ^ {3} + 3"}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.047, 0.405, 0.915, 0.451], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "但是函数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n^2"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "2^n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 就不是多项式相关的。因为不存在这样的多项式 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "p(x)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 使得不等式 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "2^n \\leqslant p(n^2)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.048, 0.466, 0.917, 0.54], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定理 5.2 设 DTM 是求解某一问题 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\Pi"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的图灵机, 对问题 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\Pi"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的任何长度为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的输入, DTM 处理它的时间复杂性是 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "T(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。那么, 存在一个求解问题 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\Pi"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的 RAM 程序, 它的时间复杂性不超过 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "O(T^{2}(n))"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.049, 0.555, 0.919, 0.628], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "证明 显然, 只要证明存在一个求解问题 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\Pi"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的 RAM 程序, 对问题 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\Pi"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的任何长度为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的输入, 其时间复杂性为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "O(T^{2}(n))"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 就可以了。所以, 通过构造一个 RAM 程序模拟求解问题 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\Pi"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "k"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 带图灵机 DTM 的工作来证明本定理。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 13, "bbox": [0.049, 0.636, 0.92, 0.792], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "首先,将 DTM 的第 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "j"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 条带上第 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "i"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 个单元与 RAM 的第 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "k(i-1)+j+c"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 单元对应起来,这就建立了带方格与 RAM 内存单元的一一对应的关系。这里 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "c"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是一个常数,它给 RAM 内存留下了 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "c"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 个工作单元。这些工作单元中有 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "k"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 个用于存放 DTM 个带头的当前位置。于是,RAM 程序可以借助于这 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "k"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 个单元,用间接寻址方式读出任何带头下的当前符号或改写任何带头下的符号,而图灵机的带头移动在 RAM 程序中,其结果修改了记录带头的当前位置的那个单元的内容。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 14, "bbox": [0.05, 0.799, 0.918, 0.845], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "在均匀耗费下,对于图灵机 DTM 的任何计算步(设时间耗费为 1 ),RAM 程序模拟它的时间耗费不超过 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "ck"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 所以一个 RAM 程序能在 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "O(T(n))"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的时间内完成对 DTM 的模拟。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 15, "bbox": [0.051, 0.853, 0.919, 0.927], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "在对数耗费下, RAM 处理一个大小为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的整数需要的时间不超过 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "O(\\log_2 n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。所以 RAM 模拟 DTM 的时间耗费不超过 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "c_1 T(n) \\log_2 n"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 这里 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "c_1"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是一个常数。因为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n \\leqslant T(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " (对于图灵机, 这是必然的), 所以 RAM 模拟 DTM 所需时间不超过 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "O(T(n) \\log_2 T(n))"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 212, "blocks": [{"type": "page_number", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.097, 0.053, 0.133, 0.067], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "200"}]}, {"type": "header", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.416, 0.051, 0.578, 0.067], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "信息安全数学基础"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.062, 0.087, 0.591, 0.105], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "对一切自然数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，函数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "T(n)\\log_2T(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 不超过 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "T^{2}(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.062, 0.115, 0.932, 0.219], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "但是这个定理的逆命题不成立。对于任意给定的充分大的整数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，存在一个 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 条指令的 RAM 程序，不需要输入，能在均匀耗费标准下的 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "O(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 时间内产生 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "2^{2^n}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 这样大的数。若用图灵机来模拟这个 RAM 程序，仅仅为了存取这个数，就需要至少 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "2^n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 个方格和计算步骤。因此，在均匀耗费标准下，本定理的逆命题不成立。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.108, 0.227, 0.915, 0.245], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "在对数耗费标准下,关于 RAM 模型和 DTM 模型的时间复杂性的关系有以下定理。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.063, 0.262, 0.933, 0.338], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定理 5.3 设 L 是一个 RAM 程序所能识别的一个语言。在对数耗费标准下, 这个 RAM 程序的时间复杂性是 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "O(T(n))"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 存在一台能识别同一个语言 L 的多带图灵机 DTM, 其时间复杂性为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "O(T^{2}(n))"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.065, 0.346, 0.932, 0.393], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "该证明可以通过构造 5 带图灵机 DTM 模拟 RAM 程序的工作来完成。证明过程有一定复杂性,感兴趣的读者可以参考姜新文等著作的《算法分析与设计》183～184 页。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.109, 0.401, 0.533, 0.42], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "综合定理 5.2 和定理 5.3 可得到以下定理。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.067, 0.436, 0.934, 0.484], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定理 5.4 在对数耗费下,对于同一个算法,采用 RAM 模型和图灵机模型的时间耗费是多项式相关的。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.065, 0.492, 0.935, 0.623], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "建立 RAM 和图灵机模型之间多项式相关的几个定理是十分必要的, 因为图灵机模型比较原始, 故要构造一台图灵机来描述一个算法是十分困难的工作。在大多数情况下, 采用 RAM 模型描述算法。在 RAM 模型下, 如果一个算法的复杂性不超过多项式 (按对数耗费标准), 这个算法在图灵机模型下也必不超过多项式 (而 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "P"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 与 NP 的分类正是基于图灵机的)。除非有特殊需要, 总是要避免直接使用图灵机模型。"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.066, 0.655, 0.53, 0.678], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "5.4 非确定性图灵机与 NP 类问题"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.066, 0.712, 0.936, 0.843], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "不难看出,5.2节所定义的 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "P"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 类语言只能用来描述那些存在有效算法的问题,即那些能在确定性图灵机上、从而在任一合理的计算模型上可在多项式时间内获得解决的问题。然而,在实际中存在许多别的重要问题,对于它们,至今尚未找到有效的求解算法。为了描述、分析这样的一类问题,需要借助于另一类图灵机作为计算模型。在引进正式的定义之前,下面先通过一个例子来说明这类问题的共同特点,从而解释相应图灵机模型产生的原因。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.067, 0.851, 0.937, 0.925], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "考虑货郎担问题对应的判定问题 t，即给定城市的一个集合，每两个城市之间的距离以及一个界 B，问是否存在一个总长不超过 B 的、通过所有城市的一个环游。对于这一问题，到现在还没有一个能真正求解它的多项式时间算法。所幸的是，要证明某人对这个例"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 213, "blocks": [{"type": "header", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.374, 0.063, 0.594, 0.078], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "第 5 章 计算复杂性基础"}]}, {"type": "page_number", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.847, 0.065, 0.883, 0.078], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "201"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.051, 0.097, 0.919, 0.2], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "子的答案的真假性是一件简单的事情。首先检验他所提供之答案是否确实为一个环游，即检查它是否包括所有的城市，且每个城市仅经过一次。如果是，就计算该环游的长度并将其与所给的界 B 进行比较以得出最终的结论。因此可以很容易设计出一个时间复杂性为多项式的一般算法来完成上述论证或检验过程。"}], "continues_prev": true}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.05, 0.207, 0.921, 0.337], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "许多别的判定问题都具有这种多项式时间可验证性。就是说,对于相应判定问题的任一个例子,一旦有了其答案的一个猜测或估计,就能设计出一个多项式时间算法来验证其真实性。然而多项式时间可验证性并不意味着多项式时间可解性。因为这里并没有考虑为了找出解的一个猜测所花去的时间,而这常常需要在指数集合中去选取一个较合理的猜测。现引入另一类图灵机以便刻画这一过程。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.052, 0.345, 0.92, 0.392], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "非确定性图灵机(Non-Deterministic Turing Machine, NDTM)完全是一种假想的机器,其定义如下。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.096, 0.408, 0.766, 0.426], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定义 5.15 非确定性 k 带图灵机(NDTM)M 由如下一个七元组构成"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.357, 0.436, 0.612, 0.455], "content": "M = (Q, T, I, \\delta , b, q _ {0}, q _ {f})"}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.052, 0.464, 0.916, 0.512], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "其中， "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "Q, T, I, \\delta, b, q_0, q_f"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的定义与定理5.2中的定义相同，"}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\delta"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是从 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "Q \\times T^k"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 到 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "Q \\times (T \\times \\{L, R, S\\})^k"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的一个映射，而且其中至少有一个映射是一对多的映射。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.052, 0.521, 0.921, 0.596], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "非确定图灵机与确定图灵机的根本不同在于下移函数  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\delta"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。注意, 一个一对多的映射意味着, 从当前状态 q 和当前扫描的 k 个带符号  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x_{1}, x_{2}, \\cdots, x_{k}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " , 可以选择新状态、新的带符号和带头移动的多种组合, 即可定义"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.191, 0.605, 0.781, 0.712], "content": "\\delta (q, x _ {1}, \\dots , x _ {k}) = \\left\\{ \\begin{array}{c} \\left(q _ {1}, \\left(a _ {1 1}, d _ {1 1}\\right), \\left(a _ {1 2}, d _ {1 2}\\right), \\dots , \\left(a _ {1 k}, d _ {1 k}\\right)\\right) \\\\ \\left(q _ {2}, \\left(a _ {2 1}, d _ {2 1}\\right), \\left(a _ {2 2}, d _ {2 2}\\right), \\dots , \\left(a _ {2 k}, d _ {2 k}\\right)\\right) \\\\ \\dots \\\\ \\left(q _ {r}, \\left(a _ {r 1}, d _ {r 1}\\right), \\left(a _ {r 2}, d _ {r 2}\\right), \\dots , \\left(a _ {r k}, d _ {r k}\\right) \\right. \\end{array} \\right\\}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.053, 0.72, 0.921, 0.766], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "式中， "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "r \\geqslant 2"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。图灵机执行时，每次可以选择（猜测）这 r 种新状态、新带符号和带头移动的某一固定的组合。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.054, 0.775, 0.922, 0.853], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "例如, 如果 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(q', (a_1', d_1), (a_2', d_2), \\cdots, (a_k', d_k)) \\in \\delta(q, a_1, a_2, \\cdots, a_k)"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 非确定性图灵机 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "M"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 正处在状态 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "q"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 且第 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "i"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 个带 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(1 \\leqslant i \\leqslant k)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 正扫描着第 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "i"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 条带上符号 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a_i"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 则机器的下一动作可以进入状态 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "q'"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 并把 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a_i"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 变为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a_i'"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 而各带头的动作由 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "d_i'"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 指定。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.052, 0.861, 0.922, 0.935], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "与确定性图灵机一样,非确定性图灵机也有格局的概念。与确定性图灵机不同,对于非确定型图灵机 M,从当前格局 D 可导致多于一个的下一格局(但仅有穷多个),若  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "D'"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  是其中之一,则记为  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "D \\stackrel{*}{\\rightarrow} D'"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ,称为 D 进入  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "D'"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 214, "blocks": [{"type": "page_number", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.093, 0.061, 0.13, 0.074], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "202"}]}, {"type": "header", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.413, 0.059, 0.575, 0.075], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "信息安全数学基础"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.057, 0.095, 0.929, 0.223], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "非确定性图灵机 M 可以用做一种语言 L 的识别器。对于语言 L，可以构造一台非确定性图灵机 M，让机器的带符包括该语言的字母表（输入字母表）及空白符 b 和其他一些特定符号（辅助符号）。机器处于初始状态时，将输入字母 w 写入至第一条带的最左边部分上，该带其他部分全为空白，而其他的带此时全为空白；把各条带的带头放在该带最左边的方格上。称输入字母 w 被这台机器接收，仅当"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.328, 0.23, 0.661, 0.249], "content": "\\langle q _ {0} w, q _ {0}, q _ {0}, \\dots , q _ {0} \\rangle \\langle a _ {1}, a _ {2}, \\dots , a _ {k} \\rangle"}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.058, 0.256, 0.514, 0.276], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "其中  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a_{1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  (因此一切  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a_{2}, \\cdots, a_{k}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ) 中有停机状态  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "q_{f}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.06, 0.291, 0.928, 0.337], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "例 5.8 试设计一台 NDTM, 它接收形如 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "10^{i_1} 10^{i_2} \\cdots 10^{i_k}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的数字, 其中 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "i_1, i_2, \\cdots, i_k"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为非负整数, 且存在集合 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "I \\subseteq \\{1, 2, \\cdots, k\\}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 使得"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.425, 0.345, 0.565, 0.379], "content": "\\sum_ {j \\in I} i _ {j} = \\sum_ {j \\notin I} i _ {j}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.059, 0.381, 0.929, 0.427], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "换言之,输入字母  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\omega"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  被接收当且仅当用输入字母  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\omega"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  所表现的数列  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "i_{1}, i_{2}, \\cdots, i_{k}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，可以被分割为两个子序列，两个子序列的各数之和相等。这个问题就是所谓等分划问题。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.059, 0.435, 0.929, 0.562], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "下面设计一台三带 NDTM 来接收所描述的语言。这台 NDTM 的工作情况是: 对输入带 1 从左到右进行扫描, 每次从带 1 上读入连续的 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "i_j"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 个 0 , 并且不确定地在带 2 或带 3 上增补进 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "i_j"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 个 0 ; 当扫描到输入末端时, 机器便核对带 2 与带 3 上 0 的个数, 若相等则接收 (注意, 可能有许多情况导致不相等, 但有一种选择导致相等)。设 NDTM = "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\langle \\{q_0, q_1, \\cdots, q_5\\}, \\{0, 1, b, \\$\\}, \\{0, 1\\}, \\delta, b, q_0, q_5 \\rangle"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 具体过程如表 5.2 所示。"}]}, {"type": "table", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.063, 0.589, 0.926, 0.913], "content": [{"type": "table_caption", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.276, 0.571, 0.714, 0.587], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "表 5.2 等分划问题非确定性图灵机 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "M"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的下移函数"}]}, {"type": "table_body", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.063, 0.589, 0.926, 0.913], "content": "<table><tr><td rowspan=\"2\">当前状态</td><td colspan=\"3\">当前带符</td><td colspan=\"3\">新带符及带头移动</td><td rowspan=\"2\">新状态</td><td rowspan=\"2\">说明</td></tr><tr><td>带1</td><td>带2</td><td>带3</td><td>带1</td><td>带2</td><td>带3</td></tr><tr><td>q0</td><td>1</td><td>b</td><td>b</td><td>1,S</td><td>$ ,R</td><td>$ ,R</td><td>q1</td><td>带1不变,带2、带3的左端写入符号$,进入状态q1</td></tr><tr><td>q1</td><td>1</td><td>b</td><td>b</td><td>1,R1,R</td><td>b,Sb,S</td><td>b,Sb,S</td><td>q2q3</td><td>开始选择:是把下一段0写入至带2(q2)上,还是写入至带2(q3)上</td></tr><tr><td>q2</td><td>01b</td><td>bb</td><td>bb</td><td>0,R1,Sb,S</td><td>0,Rb,Sb,L</td><td>b,Sb,Sb,L</td><td>q2q1q4</td><td>把所扫描的一段0复制到带2上。当带1已扫描到1时便回到q1;若在带1上扫描到b,则去进行带2、带3上0的个数的比较(q4)</td></tr><tr><td>q3</td><td>01b</td><td>bb</td><td>bb</td><td>0,R1,Sb,S</td><td>b,Sb,Sb,L</td><td>0,Rb,Sb,L</td><td>q3q1q4</td><td>与q2中在带2上的动作相似,但这次是在带3上进行</td></tr><tr><td>q4</td><td>bb</td><td>0$</td><td>0$</td><td>b,Sb,S</td><td>0,L$ ,S</td><td>0,L$ ,S</td><td>q4q5</td><td>比较带2与带3上0的个数</td></tr><tr><td>q5</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>接收</td></tr></table>"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 215, "blocks": [{"type": "header", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.379, 0.059, 0.599, 0.074], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "第5章 计算复杂性基础"}]}, {"type": "page_number", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.852, 0.06, 0.89, 0.073], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "203"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.057, 0.093, 0.925, 0.167], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "下面给该机器输入 1010010, 然后从许多可能选择的计算中, 列出两个可能的计算, 其中的第一个导致对该输入是接收的, 而第二个计算不接收该输入。因此, 按定义 5.14, 该机器接收 1010010。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.1, 0.175, 0.564, 0.194], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "关于 NDTM M 的两个移动序列如图 5.4 所示。"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.071, 0.22, 0.23, 0.237], "content": "(q _ {0} 1 0 1 0 0 1 0, q _ {0}, q _ {0})"}, {"type": "equation", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.069, 0.239, 0.289, 0.257], "content": "\\rightarrow \\left(q _ {1} 1 0 1 0 0 1 0, q _ {1}, q _ {1}\\right)"}, {"type": "equation", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.069, 0.259, 0.288, 0.277], "content": "\\rightarrow (1 q _ {2} 0 1 0 0 1 0, q _ {2}, q _ {2})"}, {"type": "equation", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.493, 0.24, 0.654, 0.257], "content": "(q _ {0} 1 0 1 0 0 1 0, q _ {0}, q _ {0})"}, {"type": "equation", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.493, 0.259, 0.712, 0.276], "content": "\\rightarrow (q _ {1} 1 0 1 0 0 1 0, q _ {1}, q _ {1})"}, {"type": "equation", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.07, 0.279, 0.297, 0.296], "content": "\\rightarrow (1 0 q _ {2} 1 0 0 1 0, \\mathbb {S} 0 q _ {2}, \\mathbb {S} q _ {2})"}, {"type": "equation", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.492, 0.279, 0.712, 0.296], "content": "\\rightarrow (1 q _ {3} 0 1 0 0 1 0, q _ {3}, q _ {3})"}, {"type": "equation", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.071, 0.299, 0.297, 0.316], "content": "\\rightarrow (10q_1 10010, \\$ 0q_1